window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-135e664cbdfe4444"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"whats-new\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">新内容</h1> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt 文档索引（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可查看 Markdown 版本。</p> <p>每项版本更新、错误修复和小幅改进，请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">ChatGPT 与 Codex 更新日志（官方来源暂不可用）</a> 和 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/changelog.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API 更新日志</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"october-1216-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-10-1216\">2026 年 10 月 12–16 日</h2> <p><a id=\"open-your-dot-from-ios-widgets-and-shortcuts\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ios-dot\">通过 iOS 小组件和快捷指令打开你的 dot</h3> <p>添加 <strong>Your dot</strong> 主屏幕小组件即可打开对话，还可选择显示消息和通话按钮。在 Apple 的 <strong>Shortcuts（快捷指令）</strong>中使用 <strong>Open your dot</strong>，并选择 <strong>Messaging（消息）</strong>、<strong>Dictation（听写）</strong> 或 <strong>Call（通话）</strong>模式。支持的机型还可将已保存的快捷指令分配给 iPhone 的操作按钮。</p> <p>这些功能正随 ChatGPT iOS 版 1.2026.279 分批推出，且需要<a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">访问 dot 的资格</a>。请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-4b4aabd54f9e5c9c?anchor=ios-widgets-and-shortcuts\">设置小组件和快捷指令</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"october-59-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-10-59\"><a href=\"#/article/a-e50abb55fbf87aa6\">2026 年 10 月 5–9 日</a></h2> <p><a id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-dot\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b1af804010bca37b\">在 ChatGPT 移动应用中创建你的 dot</a></h3> <p>你可以在手机上创建 dot，为它命名、自定义外观并连接插件。本周的 dots 更新还带来了更多来自 ChatGPT 和 Codex 的上下文、更快的云端浏览，以及通知、设置和日常使用方面的修复。</p> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-61-sol-with-ultrafast-mode\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ultrafast-gpt-61-sol\">在 Ultrafast 模式下使用 GPT-6.1 Sol</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast 模式</a>可加快 Codex 和 ChatGPT Work 中 GPT-6.1 Sol 的词元（token）生成速度。Pro $500 计划，以及符合资格的 Enterprise 和 Edu 计划可以使用 Ultrafast。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-e50abb55fbf87aa6\">阅读完整更新 →</a></p> <h2 id=\"devday-2026\"><a href=\"#/article/a-f45de159970ea06a\">DevDay 2026</a></h2> <p><a id=\"devday-roundup-title\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"meet-your-dot\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"dot\">让你的 dot 持续承担工作</h3> <p>为你的 dot 指定持续负责的工作。dot 会在不同对话之间继续推进任务，目前正逐步向符合条件的账户推出。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">认识 dot</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">可用范围</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-8b62a89b49b84e46\">管理员指南</a></p> <p><a id=\"work-across-devices\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">跨设备继续工作</h3> <p>在桌面端开始一项同步的 Work 任务，然后在网页端或移动端接着处理。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c7688c996bc9669?anchor=continue-work-across-devices\">开始使用 Work</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">设置同步</a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-space\">ChatGPT Space</h3> <p>把文件和 Pages 汇集在一起，并与协作者共同处理。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8\">开始使用</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">与智能体协作</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b\">协作</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-315e17f0f4b919c1\">管理员指南</a></p> <p><a id=\"astra-ultrafast-in-codex\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-astra-ultrafast\">在 Codex 中使用 Astra Ultrafast</h3> <p>在 Codex 和 Work 中获得更快响应；适用于 Pro $500 以及符合条件的 Enterprise 和 Edu 套餐。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast 模式</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">套餐与用量</a></p> <p><a id=\"reusable-cloud-environments\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_3\">可重复使用的云端环境</h3> <p>只需准备一次开发环境，即可在彼此隔离的云端工作区中重复使用。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">云端环境</a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-security-cloud\">Codex Security Cloud</h3> <p>在研究预览阶段扫描代码仓库、审查发现的问题，并准备修复补丁。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">设置 Security Cloud</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-0c53ef5188800731\">威胁模型</a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt\">使用 ChatGPT 登录</h3> <p>在你的应用中提供 ChatGPT 登录，并支持符合条件的 ChatGPT 套餐用量。商业登录目前仅向选定合作伙伴限量试用。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/quickstart.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快速入门</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/token-sharing-open-source.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">开源应用</a></p> <p><a id=\"sites-with-connected-data\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"sites\">连接数据的 Sites</h3> <p>在启用此功能时，构建仅限工作区内部访问的 Sites，并读取每位访客已连接的应用数据。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=load-visitor-data-via-plugins\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">通过插件构建（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=control-access-and-secrets\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">共享与访问权限（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> <p><a id=\"plugin-extensions\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_4\">插件扩展</h3> <p>为 ChatGPT 添加侧边栏应用、面板、编辑器和表单。Composer 提及需要桌面应用；Free 和 Go 网页版扩展即将推出。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/extensions.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">构建扩展</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/plugins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打包插件</a></p> <p><a id=\"mcp-events\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"mcp\">MCP 事件</h3> <p>让用户向 ChatGPT 发出请求，使其根据 MCP 服务器的更新采取行动。需要 MCP 2.0 和 Webhook 送达机制。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/mcp-events.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">构建事件订阅</a></p> <p><a id=\"website-annotations\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_5\">网站批注</h3> <p>为受支持的桌面浏览器中的反馈添加上下文和预览控件。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">批注扩展能力</a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</h3> <p>在 API 和 Codex 中使用 GPT-6.1 Sol 处理复杂编程与专业工作，具体取决于可用范围。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API 模型</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">Codex 可用范围</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/responses-multi-agent.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">多智能体 Beta</a></p> <p><a id=\"astra-ultrafast-in-the-api\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"api-astra-ultrafast\">在 API 中使用 Astra Ultrafast</h3> <p>在 Responses API 中更快生成输出词元，具体可用情况以发布安排为准。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/ultrafast-mode.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ultrafast 指南</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing?latest-pricing=ultrafast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">定价（本地尚未收录）</a></p> <p><a id=\"chatgpt-in-slack-and-teams\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"slack-teams-chatgpt\">Slack 和 Teams 中的 ChatGPT</h3> <p>在 Slack 和 Teams 对话中使用 ChatGPT 及已获批准的工具。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-6be952b78a5da779\">Slack 与 Teams 指南</a></p> <h3 id=\"team-tasks\">Team Tasks（团队任务）</h3> <p>通过团队的服务账户和已批准的连接，运行定时任务或由事件触发的工作。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-81de09346a07fee6\">设置 Team Tasks</a></p> <p><a id=\"workspace-connections\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_6\">工作区连接</h3> <p>为受支持的团队和工作流连接由公司管理的账户。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d409bf3c6a23c7d1\">管理共享连接</a></p> <p><a id=\"agent-security\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_7\">智能体安全</h3> <p>管理本地与云端智能体的工具、文件和网络访问权限。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-dccd5924f08b9ad8\">智能体安全</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-77481efb12a63f4e\">托管配置</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">Work 同步</a></p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-f45de159970ea06a\">阅读完整更新 →</a></p> <p><a id=\"september-28october-2-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-9-28-10-2\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b9b242960e2269f3\">2026 年 9 月 28 日–10 月 2 日</a></h2> <p><a id=\"choose-gpt-61-sol-for-complex-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-61-sol_1\">为复杂工作选择 GPT-6.1 Sol</h3> <p>使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</a> 进行编程和专业工作，费用低于 Astra。是否可用取决于你的套餐、客户端和工作区设置。</p> <p><a id=\"delegate-ongoing-work-to-your-dot\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"dot_1\">把持续性工作交给你的 dot</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">dot 智能体</a> 会在不同对话之间继续工作，并带回结果供你审阅。该功能正<a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">逐步向符合条件的账户开放</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-6-astra-ultrafast\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-6-astra-ultrafast\">使用 GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast（超高速模式）</a> 可加快 Codex 和 Work 中的词元生成速度，适用于 Pro $500 以及符合条件的 Enterprise 和 Edu 套餐。用量和工作区限制仍然适用。</p> <p><a id=\"prepare-reusable-codex-cloud-environments\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-cloud\">准备可重复使用的 Codex Cloud 环境</h3> <p>只需<a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">准备并发布云环境</a>一次，之后即可在隔离的工作区中为新任务重复使用该环境的文件系统。</p> <p><a id=\"scan-repositories-with-codex-security-cloud\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-security-cloud_1\">使用 Codex Security Cloud 扫描代码仓库</h3> <p>安装<a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">Security Cloud 插件</a>，即可扫描已连接的代码仓库并审查发现的问题和修复补丁。仅向有权使用的工作区提供研究预览。</p> <p><a id=\"continue-work-across-devices\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"work\">跨设备继续 Work 任务</h3> <p>启用<a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">Work Cloud 的本地计算机访问</a>后，可在桌面端、网页端或移动端继续符合条件的任务。若任务步骤需要本地资源，请保持电脑联网。</p> <p><a id=\"work-together-in-chatgpt-space\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-space_1\">在 ChatGPT Space 中协作</h3> <p>创建并共享<a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Space 中的 Pages</a>。编辑时可以提及 ChatGPT 或你的 dot，也可以使用<a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">斜杠命令</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"set-up-shared-team-workflows\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_8\">设置共享团队工作流</h3> <p>使用服务账户和已批准的工作区连接，运行定时或由事件触发的<a href=\"#/article/a-81de09346a07fee6\">Team Tasks（团队任务）</a>。管理员还可以管理<a href=\"#/article/a-6be952b78a5da779\">在 Slack 和 Teams 中访问 ChatGPT</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"sign-in-to-apps-with-chatgpt\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt_1\">使用 ChatGPT 登录应用</h3> <p>在应用中加入<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/quickstart.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT 登录与符合条件的套餐用量</a>。商业登录目前仅限量试用；套餐用量支持开源合作伙伴和选定的私有客户端。</p> <p><a id=\"extend-your-plugins-interface\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_9\">扩展插件界面</h3> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/extensions.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">插件扩展</a> 可为 ChatGPT 添加界面。Composer 提及仅支持桌面端；Free 和 Go 网页版扩展即将推出。</p> <p><a id=\"respond-to-mcp-events\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"mcp_1\">响应 MCP 事件</h3> <p>构建<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/mcp-events.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Webhook 订阅</a>，让用户可以要求 ChatGPT 根据 MCP 服务器更新采取行动。此功能需要 MCP 2.0。</p> <p><a id=\"customize-website-annotations\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_10\">自定义网站批注</h3> <p>使用<a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Browser Annotation API</a>，为受支持的桌面浏览器中的网站反馈附加上下文和预览控件。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b9b242960e2269f3\">阅读完整更新 →</a></p> <p><a id=\"september-2125-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-9-2125\">2026 年 9 月 21–25 日</h2> <p><a id=\"choose-gpt-6-sol-and-luna\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-6-sol-gpt-6-luna\">选择 GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna</h3> <p>GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna 正在 Codex 中逐步推出，其词元价格低于前代 GPT-5.6。日常及复杂编码任务可从 <strong>Sol Medium</strong> 开始；需要专注、可重复执行的任务可选择 <strong>Luna High</strong>。是否可用取决于你的套餐、客户端和工作区设置。</p> <p>如需了解模型选择，请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">模型</a>；如需了解用量和额度费率，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">定价</a>；可用范围详情请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-22-gpt-6-sol-luna\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">发布公告</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"september-1418-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-9-1418\">2026 年 9 月 14–18 日</h2> <p><a id=\"prepare-for-gpt-55-retirement\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-55\">为 GPT-5.5 退役做好准备</h3> <p>GPT-5.5 将于 2026 年 10 月 14 日从 ChatGPT、ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 退役，适用于所有套餐。OpenAI API 不受影响。</p> <p>如果你在 Codex 中使用 ChatGPT 登录，请根据自己的套餐和客户端选择可用的替代模型。迁移指南请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-55-retirement\">GPT-5.5 退役说明</a>。请在退役日期前更新仍选择 GPT-5.5 的已保存模型设置、工作区默认值、自定义智能体、定时任务和脚本。<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-14-gpt-55-retirement\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读退役通知</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>了解详情。</p> <p><a id=\"september-711-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-9-711\">2026 年 9 月 7–11 日</h2> <p><a id=\"start-a-quick-chat-from-your-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_11\">从宠物控件快速发起聊天</h3> <p>在 macOS 和 Windows 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，可通过悬浮的<a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">宠物控件</a>输入请求或开始语音对话。你可以一边在其他应用中继续工作，一边查看进度；需要时再打开完整对话。</p> <p>在 <strong>Settings &gt; Pets（设置 &gt; 宠物）</strong> 中选择陪伴宠物，或选择 <strong>Mini（迷你模式）</strong>，在不显示宠物的情况下使用这些控件。在 macOS 上按 <strong>Option+Space</strong>，或在 Windows 上按 <strong>Windows+Alt+P</strong>，即可显示控件并聚焦到 Quick Chat（快速聊天）。使用 <code>@</code> 添加上下文，使用 <code>$</code> 选择技能，然后按 <strong>Enter</strong> 发送请求。</p> <p><a id=\"share-an-app-window-on-windows\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"windows\">在 Windows 上分享应用窗口</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a> 会将当前置顶 Windows 应用的屏幕截图和可用文本带入 ChatGPT。请同时按下两个 <strong>Alt</strong> 键，然后询问窗口相关问题，或描述你想做什么。Windows 上的 Appshots 会在 ChatGPT 主应用中打开。</p> <p>在 macOS 上，如果悬浮宠物控件可见且 ChatGPT 主窗口位于后台，Appshots 也可以在该控件中发起新聊天。请先在主应用中将 <strong>Appshot destination（应用快照目标）</strong> 设为 <strong>Automatic（自动）</strong>，并授予 Appshots 所需权限。</p> <p>请更新桌面应用以使用这些功能。具体可用性取决于功能推出进度和工作区设置。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 9 月 11 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>，了解完整更新及其他小幅改进。</p> <p><a id=\"august-31september-4-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-8-31-9-4\">2026 年 8 月 31 日–9 月 4 日</h2> <p><a id=\"take-on-demanding-work-with-gpt-6-astra\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-6-astra\">使用 GPT-6 Astra 处理高难度工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-6-astra\">GPT-6 Astra</a> 将先进推理、计算机使用能力和更强的判断能力结合起来，可在 Codex 和 ChatGPT Work 中处理涉及代码、应用和研究的复杂工作。你可以让它执行一套工作流程、检查结果，并生成符合模板和任务要求的文档、电子表格或演示文稿。</p> <p>当 Astra 对你的账户开放后，可在模型选择器中选择它。开始大型任务前，请查看<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">用量与定价</a>。企业版是否可用，既取决于功能推出资格，也取决于管理员是否启用。</p> <p><a id=\"august-2428-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-8-2428\">2026 年 8 月 24–28 日</h2> <p><a id=\"work-with-more-websites\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_12\">在更多网站上工作</h3> <ul> <li> <p><strong>使用浏览器：</strong> 在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，除了 Chrome，也可通过 <a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Edge、Brave、Opera 或 Vivaldi</a>工作。你可以把已打开的标签页带入 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 对话，并在已登录的网站中继续操作。Opera 支持浏览器控制，但没有侧边聊天功能。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>使用网站提供的工具：</strong> 借助 <a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">Site tools（WebMCP）</a>，ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 可以在桌面应用的内置浏览器中使用网站提供的操作。例如，文档编辑器可以提供查找章节或添加评论的工具。请更新桌面应用，并使用 GPT-5.6 Sol 或 GPT-5.6 Terra。GPT-5.6 Luna、Enterprise 和 Edu 工作区不支持 Site tools。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>通过云端浏览器登录：</strong> 符合条件的套餐可在网页、iOS 或 Android 版 ChatGPT Work 中继续需要网站账户的任务。请按照<a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=web-sign-in-to-a-website\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">登录请求（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>操作，并在登录流程中输入账户信息，而不要在聊天中输入。这不会连接你的本地浏览器配置文件。Enterprise 和 Edu 工作区不支持网站登录。</p> </li> </ul> <p>具体可用性取决于功能推出进度和工作区设置。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Edge to read the current page and turn it into a concise checklist.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">使用 @Edge 阅读当前页面，并将其整理为简明的检查清单。</div></div> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-25-browser\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 25 日浏览器发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"run-scheduled-tasks-from-app-events\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_13\">根据应用事件运行定时任务</h3> <p>现在，<a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?sectionMissing=web-trigger-tasks-from-app-events\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">定时任务（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>可以在 Gmail、Slack 或 GitHub 中发生受支持的事件时启动。你可以用事件触发器整理新邮件、概括频道动态，或根据拉取请求反馈采取行动，而不必按固定间隔轮询。</p> <p>符合条件的套餐可以在网页和移动版 ChatGPT 中使用事件触发任务。请先连接相关应用并批准其请求的访问权限。在受管理的工作区中，管理员可以控制访问权限。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">When one of my pull requests in &lt;owner&gt;/&lt;repository&gt; receives new review feedback, summarize the feedback and prepare a revision plan.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">当我在 &lt;owner&gt;/&lt;repository&gt; 中的某个拉取请求收到新的审查反馈时，总结反馈并准备修改计划。</div></div> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-25-event-triggers\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 25 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"august-1721-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-8-1721\">2026 年 8 月 17–21 日</h2> <p><a id=\"work-with-more-of-your-apps-and-content\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_14\">使用更多应用和内容</h3> <ul> <li> <p><strong>Apple Messages：</strong> <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a?sectionMissing=app-use-apple-messages-from-codex\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">在 Mac 上查找聊天、概括消息、准备回复并通过 Messages 发送（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>。该插件面向所有套餐，在 macOS 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用中提供。可在 ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 中使用，不适用于普通 ChatGPT 聊天。默认情况下，ChatGPT 只有在你批准消息内容和收件人后才会发送。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>共同编辑 Site：</strong> 在支持的情况下，<a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=collaborate-on-a-site\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">邀请工作区中的活跃成员担任编辑者（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>。Site 所有者首次发布后，编辑者可以完善 Site 并发布更新。受邀编辑者可以读取 Site 的实时数据库数据；所有者仍可控制共享和设置。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>编辑 Site 地址：</strong> 在支持的情况下，<a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=change-a-site-url\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">为现有 Site 选择新的 ChatGPT 托管地址（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>，无需重新部署。旧地址会重定向到新地址。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>欧洲地区的 Computer History：</strong> 在欧洲经济区（EEA）、瑞士和英国使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-f3a0216fc3d2956b\">Computer History</a>。对于 macOS 上的 ChatGPT Pro、Business 和 Enterprise 用户，该功能默认仍处于关闭状态。Business 和 Enterprise 管理员必须先启用访问权限。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>共享对话线程快照：</strong> 在 macOS 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，<a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f?anchor=share-a-read-only-snapshot-of-a-codex-thread\">分享本地 Codex 线程的只读快照</a>。个人账户生成的链接可供任何获得链接的人查看；工作区账户的链接仅限原工作区成员查看。Codex 会遮盖已知的密钥模式，但快照中仍可能保留敏感内容，分享前请先检查。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>统一置顶线程：</strong> 让桌面版和 iOS 版之间的<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?sectionMissing=app-organize-projects-and-chats\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">置顶聊天（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>保持同步。</p> </li> </ul> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Find the latest Messages conversation about tomorrow's launch, summarize the open questions, and draft a reply without sending it.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">查找 Messages 中关于明天发布的最新对话，总结待解答问题，并起草回复，但不要发送。</div></div> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-20-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 20 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>Codex 和 ChatGPT Work 中的共享线程可以通过只读链接展示你的构建过程</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2090555241343418814\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-08-20）</p> <p><a id=\"work-with-gitlab-projects-in-codex-cloud\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-gitlab\">在 Codex 云端使用 GitLab 项目</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-e0c9ac1b89ddeeb2\">GitLab 支持</a>已在所有 ChatGPT 套餐中以 Beta 形式提供。你可以连接项目、创建云端环境、根据议题或合并请求使用 <code>@codex</code> 启动任务，并请求一次性或自动化的合并请求审查。</p> <p>该集成运行在 Codex 云端，受管理工作区的管理员可以将其关闭。由 GitLab 事件触发的活动需要相应 webhook 配置权限。GitLab Self-Managed 和 GitLab Dedicated 连接需要工作区管理员设置；webhook 事件要求 GitLab 19.0 或更高版本。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-19-gitlab\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 19 日 GitLab 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"export-public-plugin-metadata-for-review\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_15\">导出公开插件元数据以供审查</h3> <p>符合条件的 ChatGPT Enterprise 工作区所有者和管理员可以下载 CSV，其中列出工作区可见的公开插件。在<a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/admin/plugins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">管理 &gt; 插件（需联网）</a>中选择 <strong>Public（公开）</strong>，再选择下载图标（<strong>Export CSV，导出 CSV</strong>）。</p> <p>导出内容包括插件、应用和 Chat 技能的名称与描述，以及开发者、版本、添加日期（UTC）和 OpenAI 验证元数据。数据来自公开目录快照，可能最多落后 48 小时，不包括为该工作区创建的插件。FedRAMP 工作区不提供此导出功能。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-17-admin-csv\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 17 日管理员导出发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"august-1014-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-8-1014\">2026 年 8 月 10–14 日</h2> <p><a id=\"find-earlier-work-with-computer-history\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"computer-history\">使用 Computer History 查找早先的工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-f3a0216fc3d2956b\">Computer History</a>会把你在应用和网站中的活动整理为可搜索的时间线和记忆，供 ChatGPT 与 Codex 使用。仅在你愿意共享这些上下文时才开启；之后可选择哪些应用和网站参与、暂停收集，并随时查看或删除历史记录。</p> <p>Computer History 面向 macOS 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用中的 ChatGPT Pro、Business 和 Enterprise 用户。Business 和 Enterprise 管理员必须先启用该功能。初始开放范围不包括欧盟、瑞士和英国。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Find the document and Slack thread I was reviewing earlier, then summarize the decisions I still need to act on.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">找到我之前正在查看的文档和 Slack 讨论串，然后总结仍需要我采取行动的决定。</div></div> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W-HhMUe9hOg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：ChatGPT 中的 Computer History（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"use-the-chatgpt-desktop-app-on-linux\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"linux-chatgpt\">在 Linux 上使用 ChatGPT 桌面应用</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Linux 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用</a>现已进入预览阶段。受支持的 Ubuntu 或 Debian 发行版可安装 <code>.deb</code> 软件包，Fedora 可安装 <code>.rpm</code> 软件包。x64 和 ARM64 处理器均有对应软件包。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT 账户登录后，即可使用项目、本地文件和 Codex。Linux 预览版暂不支持部分功能，包括 Computer Use。</p> <blockquote> <p>现已进入预览：Linux 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2087231350134980830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-08-11）</p> <p><a id=\"bring-your-existing-agent-setup-and-work-with-you\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_16\">带上你已有的智能体设置和工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\">将 Claude Code、Claude Cowork 或 Cursor 中的指令、设置、技能、插件、项目和最近的工作导入 ChatGPT 桌面应用</a>。在 Settings &gt; Import（设置 &gt; 导入）中开启自动更新，使导入的工作保持同步。</p> <p>在 Codex CLI 中，使用 <code>/import</code> 可将 Claude Code 或 Cursor 中受支持的配置和近期聊天导入本地会话。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 11 日桌面版和 CLI 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>现在，你可以让来自其他智能体的工作与 ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 保持同步。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2087242829076791392\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-08-11）</p> <p><a id=\"choose-the-right-access-for-defensive-security-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_17\">为防御性安全工作选择合适的访问权限</h3> <p>Daybreak 现在为获批的防御人员提供两个级别。<strong>Daybreak Blue</strong> 支持常见的防御工作，例如安全代码审查、事件响应和补丁验证。<strong>Daybreak Red</strong> 需要单独审批，并可使用为授权安全评估专门训练的模型。</p> <p>访问需要通过<a href=\"#/article/a-04f6dcc4a4fe6044?anchor=trusted-access-for-cyber\">网络安全可信访问计划（Trusted Access for Cyber）</a>，且仅适用于获批的身份、工作区或组织、模型和产品界面。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-10-daybreak\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 8 月 10 日 Daybreak 公告</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>我们正在扩展网络安全计划 Daybreak</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2086864365379010729\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-08-10）</p> <p><a id=\"august-37-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-8-37\">2026 年 8 月 3–7 日</h2> <p><a id=\"talk-through-files-and-projects-with-chatgpt-voice\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt_2\">用 ChatGPT 语音讨论文件和项目</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT 语音</a>现在支持上传的文件和 <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">ChatGPT 项目</a>。你可以在语音对话中询问文档内容，也可以根据项目中的近期聊天、资料来源和指令继续推进项目。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the research brief I uploaded, explain the main tradeoffs out loud, and compare them with the sources already in this project.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">查看我上传的研究简报，用语音解释主要取舍，并将它们与这个项目中已有的来源进行比较。</div></div> <p><a id=\"study-and-teach-with-dedicated-education-plugins\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_18\">使用专门的教育插件进行学习和教学</h3> <p>三个新的<a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a>为 ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 带来面向课堂的工作流程。<strong>College Student</strong> 可制作学习指南、练习测验、抽认卡和互动式讲解。<strong>College Educator</strong> 可协助制定课程计划、教学材料和评估内容。<strong>K–12 Educator</strong> 支持课程规划、课堂资源，以及适配不同学习者的材料。</p> <p>这些插件通过 ChatGPT Edu 和面向学区部署的 ChatGPT for Teachers 提供。学校可以控制可用的工具和权限。请阅读<a href=\"https://openai.com/index/learn-teach-chatgpt-work-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">教育插件公告（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"reuse-saved-files-and-find-past-work-faster\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_19\">重用已保存的文件，更快找到以前的工作</h3> <p>在网页端，你可以将已保存到 Library 的文件添加到对话中，无需再次上传；也可以在 Library 中搜索，并粘贴保留标题、链接和列表格式的文本。网页、iOS 和 Android 端的搜索还可以匹配文件夹及对话标题。</p> <p>现在，在所有 ChatGPT 套餐中（包括 Enterprise 和 Edu），超过 10,000 个字符的粘贴内容都会转换为附件。如果要把内容放回消息中，请选择 <strong>Show in text field（在文本框中显示）</strong>。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT 发布说明（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"see-your-remaining-chatgpt-work-usage\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-work\">查看剩余的 ChatGPT Work 用量</h3> <p>符合条件的个人套餐和 ChatGPT Business 用户可以直接在网页侧边栏查看剩余的 ChatGPT Work 用量。可用额度选项取决于账户及工作区权限。ChatGPT Work 与 Codex 仍共用<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">用量限制和额度</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-how-gpt-56-responds-in-chatgpt\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-56-chatgpt\">选择 GPT-5.6 在 ChatGPT 中的回答方式</h3> <p>ChatGPT Plus 和 Pro 用户现在可以通过新的滑块调整 GPT-5.6 Sol 思考的程度。更新后的模型也能提供更可靠的事实和更聚焦的回答。GPT-5.6 Luna 成为 Free 和 Go 套餐的默认 ChatGPT 模型。</p> <p>这些变化适用于 ChatGPT 对话，不会改变 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 中的模型行为。请阅读 <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT 发布说明（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"organize-work-and-switch-agents-in-codex-cli-01470\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-cli-01470\">在 Codex CLI 0.147.0 中整理工作并切换智能体</h3> <p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.147.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex CLI 0.147.0（需联网）</a>新增了可持久保存、可手动排序的聊天分区，以及可移植的 Agent Plugins。你可以搜索本地、个人、工作区和远程插件目录，或<a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\">导入 Cursor 和 Claude Code 配置</a>，而不会重复创建已同步的对话。</p> <p>使用 <code>--approve-for-me</code>，即可为符合条件的请求启用<a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">自动审批审查</a>，且不会扩大文件系统或网络权限。Amazon Bedrock 会话还新增了缓存网页搜索和远程对话压缩功能。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UaeWJK_vv-Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 Agent Plugins（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"follow-and-resume-deeper-security-scans\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_20\">跟踪并恢复更深入的安全扫描</h3> <p>托管版 Codex Security 插件 <code>0.1.16</code> 至 <code>0.1.18</code> 增加了实时扫描进度、词元用量统计、可恢复的深度扫描和可配置的发现上限。最新版本还支持通过 Amazon Bedrock 身份验证来扫描代码仓库及其委派的工作进程。</p> <p>可使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-8486fe00c240100d\">Codex Security 工作台</a>查看扫描进度和发现结果；需要更全面的评估时，可<a href=\"#/article/a-03d337741f7199f7\">配置深度扫描</a>。请查看<a href=\"#/article/a-796d8353993fb17e\">插件更新日志</a>，确认你安装的版本支持哪些功能。</p> <p><a id=\"review-github-pull-requests-for-security-risks\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"github\">检查 GitHub 拉取请求中的安全风险</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-862c857e0358aa15\">Codex Security Review</a>会结合代码仓库上下文、威胁模型和安全指南，分析拉取请求中的变更。你可以设置在拉取请求创建或收到新提交时自动审查，也可以直接使用 <code>@codex security review</code> 请求审查。</p> <p>该功能以研究预览版向符合条件的 ChatGPT Enterprise、Business、Edu 和 Pro 用户提供。Plus 套餐不可用，且可能受用量限制。</p> <blockquote> <p>现已进入研究预览：Codex Security Review</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2085482310636560830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-08-06）</p> <p><a id=\"july-2731-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-7-2731\">2026 年 7 月 27–31 日</h2> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-56-terra-and-luna-at-lower-rates\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-56-terra-luna\">以更低费率使用 GPT-5.6 Terra 和 Luna</h3> <p>GPT-5.6 Terra 现已降价 20%，GPT-5.6 Luna 降价 80%。输入、缓存输入和输出的费率均按相同比例下调。更新后的<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">用量限制与费率</a>让 Terra 更适合日常工作，而 Luna 尤其适用于专注的编码任务和高用量工作。</p> <blockquote> <p>从今天起，GPT-5.6 Luna 降价 80%，GPT-5.6 Terra 降价 20%。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2082878156483219672\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-07-30）</p> <p><a id=\"find-useful-context-across-your-browser-and-open-tabs\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_21\">在浏览器和打开的标签页中查找有用上下文</h3> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，<a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">内置浏览器</a>可以从浏览历史中查找页面，也可以直接从地址栏搜索 Google。任务需要先前的上下文时，ChatGPT 也可以搜索你的浏览历史。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Chrome 扩展</a>允许你在对话中提及打开的标签页、将选定的页面文字带入侧边聊天、询问 YouTube 视频内容，或从网页的右键菜单中选择 <strong>Ask ChatGPT（询问 ChatGPT）</strong>。ChatGPT 在任务中使用浏览历史前，会先征求你审查并批准。</p> <blockquote> <p>在侧边聊天中询问 YouTube 视频、引用已打开的标签页，或选中网页文字后直接提问。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/ChatGPT/status/2082970812584432115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @ChatGPT（需联网）</a>（2026-07-30）</p> <p><a id=\"review-changes-across-repositories\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_22\">跨代码仓库审查变更</h3> <p>当<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=use-local-projects-for-folders-and-codebases\">本地项目包含多个文件夹</a>时，桌面应用会显示每个代码仓库及其中变更的行数。选择 <strong>Review（审查）</strong>，即可一起检查这些差异，而无需在多个独立的审查视图间切换。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the changes across every repository in this project, identify integration risks, and summarize the fixes needed before I open a pull request.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">审查这个项目中每个代码仓库的更改，识别集成风险，并总结我创建拉取请求之前需要完成的修复。</div></div> <p><a id=\"refine-generated-images-in-your-conversation\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_23\">在对话中细化生成的图像</h3> <p>在展开的查看器中打开生成的图像，然后在 <strong>Focused view（聚焦视图）</strong> 和 <strong>Canvas view（画布视图）</strong> 之间切换。你可以在图像上添加评论、选择要保留的版本，并直接在聊天中提出针对性修改。了解更多关于<a href=\"#/article/a-6e5b50840145f8df\">图像生成</a>的信息。</p> <blockquote> <p>Codex 中的 ImageGen 刚刚新增了灯箱和画布。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2082944138635595782\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-07-30）</p> <p><a id=\"find-chats-that-need-your-attention\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_24\">找出需要你关注的聊天</h3> <p>桌面应用新增的 <strong>Activity view（活动视图）</strong> 汇总你最近参与的聊天，以及需要你处理的工作。选择侧边栏中的铃铛即可打开该视图。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-30-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 7 月 30 日桌面版发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 桌面应用全新的 Activity view（活动视图）汇集了需要你关注的对话。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2083288643310133716\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-07-31）</p> <p><a id=\"connect-partner-tools-with-sign-in-with-chatgpt\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt\">使用 Sign in with ChatGPT 连接合作伙伴工具</h3> <p><strong>Sign in with ChatGPT</strong> 正在向受支持的插件和合作伙伴网站逐步推出 Beta，首批包括 Airtable、GitLab、HubSpot、Notion、Supabase 和 Vercel。你可以用更少步骤创建或关联合作伙伴账户，然后在 ChatGPT 或 Codex 中开始使用该服务。</p> <p>在可用时，合作伙伴只会收到你的姓名、电子邮件地址和个人头像。每个插件所请求的访问权限仍需单独审查和批准。请阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-29\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">7 月 29 日登录功能公告</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"collaborate-in-a-dedicated-academic-research-workspace\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_25\">在专门的学术研究工作区中协作</h3> <p><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-for-academic-researchers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT for Academic Researchers（需联网）</a>为符合条件的教师和博士后研究人员提供为期 12 个月的免费专用 ChatGPT 工作区。获批团队最多可包括同一机构的五名经验证研究人员，并享有商业数据保护和 ChatGPT Pro 级别的用量限制。参与者可在 ChatGPT、ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 中使用 GPT-5.6 开展研究与编码工作。</p> <p>该计划提供的是 ChatGPT 使用权限，不包括 OpenAI API 额度。申请资格要求<a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001406\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">完成机构验证并提交符合条件的研究论文（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLehRytu9Zo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：我们将为 10 万名学术研究人员免费提供前沿模型使用权（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"continue-codex-tasks-more-reliably-on-ios\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ios-codex\">在 iOS 上更可靠地继续 Codex 任务</h3> <p>ChatGPT for iOS 1.2026.202 在你返回应用或通过 Face ID 解锁设备时，能更可靠地重新连接任务。语音对话会使用你选定的 ChatGPT 声音并显示用量限制提醒；消息编辑框现在也能像桌面应用一样稳定地推荐已安装的插件及其技能。</p> <p>此版本还改进了目标的暂停和恢复控件、行内表格和视觉主题、大型工作区差异、选中文字引用以及模型恢复。请阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-27-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">7 月 27 日 iOS 版发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"compare-security-scans-and-manage-findings\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_26\">比较安全扫描并管理发现结果</h3> <p>托管版 Codex Security 插件 <code>0.1.14</code> 和 <code>0.1.15</code> 新增扫描结果比较、误报反馈、按范围应用的 <code>SECURITY.md</code> 策略，以及更清晰的代码仓库与发现结果历史记录。你可以选择要在 Linear 或 GitHub Issues 中跟踪的发现结果；Codex 会先审查拟议操作，再由你批准。</p> <p>可在桌面应用中使用现有的 <a href=\"#/article/a-8486fe00c240100d\">Codex Security 工作台</a>，查看已保存的扫描、发现结果、代码仓库历史和修复情况。托管插件目录提供 <code>0.1.15</code> 版，公开 CLI 插件市场提供 <code>0.1.11</code> 版。使用新功能前，请查看 <a href=\"#/article/a-796d8353993fb17e\">Codex Security 插件更新日志</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"run-security-scans-from-the-terminal-ci-or-typescript\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ci-typescript\">从终端、CI 或 TypeScript 运行安全扫描</h3> <p>公开发布的 <code>@openai/codex-security</code> CLI 和 TypeScript SDK 已更新至 <code>0.1.5</code>；其版本号与 Codex Security 插件分别管理。你可以使用该软件包<a href=\"#/article/a-1716f9f1a07bca7e\">从 CLI 运行扫描</a>、在 <a href=\"#/article/a-8d926b82884d5f99\">CI</a> 中审查拉取请求变更并上传 SARIF 结果，或针对 GitHub 代码仓库和固定的 CSV 清单运行可恢复的<a href=\"#/article/a-0462b3e291010c32\">批量扫描</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-13b97f7316a6bfd5\">Codex Security TypeScript SDK</a>还允许你将扫描、进度报告、成本控制和取消操作集成到自己的工具中。该软件包是公开的，但运行扫描仍需获得 Codex Security 访问权限。部分完整代码仓库扫描还需要通过 Trusted Access for Cyber 审批。</p> <blockquote> <p>现在，你可以用它扫描代码仓库、跨多次运行跟踪发现结果、验证修复，并在 CI/CD 中加入安全检查。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2082263717916586117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-07-29）</p> <p><a id=\"organize-sessions-and-extend-codex-cli-01460\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-cli-01460\">整理会话并扩展 Codex CLI 0.146.0</h3> <p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.146.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex CLI 0.146.0（需联网）</a>支持使用 <code>/new release prep</code> 为新聊天命名，或使用 <code>/clear bug bash</code> 命名并清空聊天；还可以置顶重要线程，并在不同的侧边对话间切换而不关闭它们。此版本还新增了临时对话分支、兼容的自定义模型提供商可独立使用的网页搜索、由执行器提供的技能，以及 Agent Plugins 清单、工作区插件发布和其他插件市场支持。</p> <p>对于自定义客户端，<a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">app server</a>可以筛选置顶线程、创建内存中的分支、检查已安装连接器状态并读取连接器元数据。实验性的 WebSocket 支持还可将 app-server 连接到远程 Code Mode 主机。开放远程连接前，请先查看 <a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1?sectionMissing=connect-the-cli-terminal-ui\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">app-server 安全要求（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>。此版本也改进了代理支持、MCP 重新连接、终端响应速度和 Windows 沙箱可靠性。</p> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-56-sol-for-hosted-codex-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-gpt-56-sol\">在托管式 Codex 工作中使用 GPT-5.6 Sol</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=recommended-models\">GPT-5.6 Sol</a>现已为符合条件的用户提供 Codex 云端代码审查和质量保证功能。Sol 是适合复杂编码、研究、计算机使用和安全工作的 GPT-5.6 旗舰模型。Codex 云端会自动选择模型；在受支持的本地和网页界面中，仍可使用 Terra 和 Luna。</p> <p><a id=\"prepare-for-the-gpt-54-model-retirement\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-54\">为 GPT-5.4 模型退役做好准备</h3> <p>8 月 31 日，使用 ChatGPT 登录的 Codex 用户将无法再使用 GPT-5.4 和 GPT-5.4 mini。请在工作区默认值、已保存的模型设置、受管理的配置、自定义智能体和定时任务中，分别将 <code>gpt-5.4</code> 替换为 <code>gpt-5.6-terra</code>，并将 <code>gpt-5.4-mini</code> 替换为 <code>gpt-5.6-luna</code>。</p> <p>OpenAI API 和使用 API 密钥进行身份验证的 Codex 会话不受影响。截止日期前，请查看<a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=deprecated-codex-models\">已弃用的 Codex 模型</a>以及<a href=\"#/article/a-7d04f9ab1f4a3eeb\">工作区模型可用性</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"july-2024-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-7-2024\">2026 年 7 月 20–24 日</h2> <p><a id=\"talk-through-work-with-chatgpt-voice\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt_3\">使用 ChatGPT 语音讨论工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT 语音</a>由 GPT-Live 提供支持，可让你在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中通过语音讨论工作，并协调 Chat、Work 和 Codex 中的任务。你可以用语音模式开始新的聊天或任务，然后让 ChatGPT 在其他线程中开始、检查或调整工作。</p> <p>在 macOS 上，启用 <strong>Screen context（屏幕上下文）</strong> 后，说“看一下这个”，即可分享当前最前方窗口的 <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">appshot</a>。</p> <p>桌面应用和 <a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=set-up-mobile-access\">iOS 版 Remote</a>面向 Plus、Pro、Business、Edu 和 Enterprise 套餐提供语音功能。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E0ZMOschrTU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：使用 ChatGPT 语音进行创作（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"work-across-multiple-folders-in-one-local-project\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_27\">在一个本地项目中处理多个文件夹</h3> <p>现在，ChatGPT 桌面应用中的本地项目可以包含多个相关文件夹。你可以选择一个主文件夹，用于新聊天、Git 操作，以及自动发现 <code>AGENTS.md</code>、技能和 <code>config.toml</code>；其他文件夹仍可用于搜索、读取和编辑文件。</p> <p>打开 <strong>Edit project（编辑项目）</strong>，即可<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=use-local-projects-for-folders-and-codebases\">添加文件夹并选择主文件夹</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-23-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 7 月 23 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>本地项目现在可以同时包含多个文件夹中的相关代码、文档和参考资料。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2080390328880951299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-07-23）</p> <p><a id=\"july-1317-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-7-1317\">2026 年 7 月 13–17 日</h2> <p><a id=\"keep-work-conversations-and-projects-together-on-desktop\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"work_1\">在桌面端将 Work 对话与项目放在一起</h3> <p>ChatGPT 桌面应用现在会在 ChatGPT 视图中将 Chat 和 Work 对话放在一起。云端 Work 对话会在网页、移动端和桌面端同步；本地 Work 对话则保留在你的电脑上。ChatGPT 项目现已可在桌面应用中使用。Codex 仍保留独立视图和面向开发者工作流程的单独历史记录。</p> <p>请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f?anchor=compare-chatgpt-work-and-codex-on-desktop\">在桌面端比较 ChatGPT Work 与 Codex</a>，选择适合任务的视图。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Open the Launch project, review its files and recent conversations, and continue the launch plan from the latest Work conversation.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">打开名为 Launch 的项目，查看其中的文件和近期对话，并从最新的 Work 对话继续推进发布计划。</div></div> <p><a id=\"control-parallel-codex-work-with-codex-micro\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-micro-codex\">使用 Codex Micro 控制并行 Codex 工作</h3> <p>7 月 15 日，OpenAI 与 Work Louder 推出了 <a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205\">Codex Micro</a>：一款限量发售、用于 ChatGPT 桌面应用中 Codex 的实体控制设备。Agent Keys 可显示最多六个聊天的状态，并在聊天间切换。可自定义的 Command Keys、摇杆和旋钮可触发常用操作或技能、开始按住说话，并调整推理强度，无需离开键盘。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m8uUUUsMD3Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 Codex Micro（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-56-through-amazon-bedrock\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"amazon-bedrock-gpt-56\">通过 Amazon Bedrock 使用 GPT-5.6</h3> <p>GPT-5.6 Sol、Terra 和 Luna 已通过 Amazon Bedrock 正式全面开放。本地 ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 界面可通过内置的 <a href=\"#/article/a-fc9fbba758a53038\"><code>amazon-bedrock</code> 提供商</a>，使用 Bedrock API 密钥或 AWS SDK 凭据链。这包括 ChatGPT 桌面应用中的 Work 和 Codex、Codex CLI、IDE 扩展以及 Codex SDK。</p> <p><a id=\"inspect-codex-task-visualizations-on-ios\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ios-codex_1\">在 iOS 上查看 Codex 任务的可视化内容</h3> <p>ChatGPT for iOS 1.2026.188 为 Codex 任务新增了行内可视化内容，并改进了从对话创建和管理任务的体验，包括确保新建任务的链接可靠可用。请阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-13-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">7 月 13 日 iOS 版发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"july-610-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-7-610\">2026 年 7 月 6–10 日</h2> <p><a id=\"take-on-ambitious-work-with-chatgpt-work\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"take-on-ambitious-work-in-chatgpt\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt_4\">在 ChatGPT 中处理有挑战性的工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c7688c996bc9669\">ChatGPT Work</a>可以在 ChatGPT 中从你的文件和<a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a>收集上下文、跨工作流程采取行动，并制作便于审阅的文档、演示文稿、电子表格、Site 等成品。它由 <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">GPT-5.6</a>驱动，可以将目标拆解为多个步骤，持续工作数小时；期间你可以跟踪进度、回答问题、调整方向并批准重要操作。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a>可以在你离开时继续推进工作：它们可以运行一次、按计划运行、在事件发生时运行，或持续监控变化。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a launch brief from the attached research and campaign template. Show me the plan and flag missing information before you build the final document, then adapt the approved brief into assets for three markets.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">根据所附研究和活动模板制作发布简报。在制作最终文档前，先向我展示计划并标出缺失信息，然后将获批的简报改编为适用于三个市场的素材。</div></div> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yRc5HcGJ-Cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：认识 ChatGPT Work（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"choose-the-right-gpt-56-model\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-56\">选择合适的 GPT-5.6 模型</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=recommended-models\">GPT-5.6 系列</a>在 ChatGPT Work、ChatGPT 桌面应用、Codex CLI 和 Codex IDE 扩展中提供三个推荐模型。Sol 是旗舰型号，适合复杂编码、计算机使用、研究和安全工作；Terra 在能力和成本间取得平衡，适合日常工作；Luna 速度最快、成本最低。默认的 <strong>Power（性能）</strong> 设置使用中等推理强度的 Sol。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MPGU2a67Ls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：认识 GPT-5.6（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"use-codex-in-the-chatgpt-desktop-app\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-codex\">在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中使用 Codex</h3> <p>7 月 9 日，Codex 应用并入适用于 macOS 和 Windows 的 <a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT 桌面应用</a>。Codex 在 ChatGPT 的 Chat 和 Work 旁边保留了专属的编码体验，其中包括差异视图中的行内编辑、侧边面板中的拉取请求审查、由 GPT-5.6 驱动且速度更快的<a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">计算机使用</a>，以及多代码仓库项目。</p> <p>现有 Codex 应用用户可照常更新。你可以将 Codex 设为默认视图、将 Codex 标志设为应用图标，并从 ChatGPT 移动应用访问桌面端 Codex 项目。更新后的桌面应用已向全球所有 ChatGPT 套餐（包括 Free）开放。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ga792ftrBu4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：面向工程团队的 Codex（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"june-1519-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-6-1519\">2026 年 6 月 15–19 日</h2> <p><a id=\"turn-demonstrated-workflows-into-reusable-skills\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_28\">将演示过的工作流程转化为可复用技能</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c6e218368c091d9\">Record &amp; Replay</a>允许你在 macOS 上向 ChatGPT 或 Codex 演示工作流程，并将演示转化为可复用的技能。你可以用它处理那些演示比文字说明更容易表达的重复性任务，然后完善生成的技能，并使用新的输入再次运行。初始开放范围不包括欧洲经济区、英国和瑞士，并且需要启用 Computer Use。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZK3JhU73W18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：在 Codex 中使用 Record &amp; Replay（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"continue-a-task-on-another-host\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"continue-a-chat-on-another-host\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_29\">在另一台主机上继续聊天</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=hand-off-a-chat-between-hosts\">聊天交接</a>可以在你的本地电脑与已连接的远程主机之间迁移聊天及其 Git 状态。Codex 可以在目标主机上创建或复用工作树，转移聊天，然后在对应项目中继续工作。</p> <p>同一桌面版更新还为定时运行历史记录增加了批量操作：你可以将所有运行记录标记为已读，或一次归档符合条件的记录。</p> <p><a id=\"browse-and-review-workspaces-from-ios\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ios\">在 iOS 上浏览和审阅工作区</h3> <p>ChatGPT 移动应用中的 <strong>Remote</strong> 为 iOS 新增了工作区文件浏览器、新聊天的目录选择器、差异视图展开和折叠控件，以及针对单个聊天或跨聊天的 MCP 审批选项。</p> <p>Computer Use、Chrome 扩展、Memories 和 Chronicle 也开始向欧洲经济区、英国和瑞士逐步开放。在这些地区，Memories 默认仍处于关闭状态；Chronicle 则是面向 macOS 上 ChatGPT Pro 用户、需主动选择加入的研究预览功能。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-15-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 15 日 iOS 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-16-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 16 日可用范围说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-18-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 18 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"june-812-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-6-812\">2026 年 6 月 8–12 日</h2> <p><a id=\"debug-web-apps-with-browser-developer-mode\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"web\">使用浏览器开发者模式调试 Web 应用</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-developer-mode\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">开发者模式（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>让 Codex 可以受控地使用 Chrome 和内置浏览器中的 Chrome DevTools Protocol（CDP）功能。分析或调试应用时，Codex 可以检查网络流量、控制台输出、运行时错误和页面状态。在 <strong>Settings（设置）</strong> &gt; <strong>Browser（浏览器）</strong> 的 <strong>Developer mode（开发者模式）</strong> 下，打开 <strong>Enable full CDP access（启用完整 CDP 访问）</strong>。Codex 在使用此权限访问网站前会明确征求你的批准。</p> <p>由于 CDP 和 DOM 快照方面的优化减少了浏览器往返操作，浏览器操作速度最高可达原先的两倍。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：已启用开发者模式的 Codex 浏览器设置</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Browser to reproduce the slow checkout. Inspect the network timing and console errors, fix the cause, and verify the result.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">使用 @Browser 复现结账流程缓慢的问题。检查网络耗时和控制台错误，修复原因，并验证结果。</div></div> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhgYFRZLyKI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：使用 Codex 浏览器功能调试 Web 应用（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"bring-your-setup-to-codex\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex\">将你的配置带到 Codex</h3> <p>新的迁移流程可以在初始设置时，从其他编码智能体导入受支持的配置。Codex 应用还新增了用于创建项目指令的 <code>/init</code>，并改进了插件管理、浏览器诊断和已完成聊天的摘要。</p> <p><a id=\"set-up-codex-tasks-from-ios\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"set-up-codex-chats-from-ios\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ios-codex_2\">在 iOS 上设置 Codex 聊天</h3> <p>iOS 版 Remote 现在可以选择分支、创建工作树、运行环境设置脚本、管理目标，并添加行内审查评论。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-09-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 9 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-09-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 9 日 iOS 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">6 月 11 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"june-15-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-6-15\">2026 年 6 月 1–5 日</h2> <p><a id=\"build-and-deploy-websites-with-sites\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"sites_1\">使用 Sites 构建并部署网站</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites</a>可让 ChatGPT 创建、保存、部署和检查由 OpenAI 托管的网站、仪表板、内部工具、Web 应用和游戏。ChatGPT 网页版和桌面版提供专门的 Sites 入口，你可以在此返回项目、管理托管环境变量和密钥，而不必自行组装一套部署技术栈。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Build a responsive launch dashboard from this project with Sites. Validate it at mobile and desktop sizes, then save a version for review. Do not deploy it until I approve the saved version.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">使用 Sites，根据这个项目构建响应式发布仪表板。在移动端和桌面端尺寸下进行验证，然后保存一个版本供审阅。在我批准这个已保存版本之前，不要部署。</div></div> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VRvC5smyzso\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 Codex 中的 Sites（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"use-codex-with-amazon-bedrock\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-amazon-bedrock\">将 Codex 与 Amazon Bedrock 配合使用</h3> <p>你可以在本地工作流程中<a href=\"#/article/a-fc9fbba758a53038\">通过 Amazon Bedrock 使用 Codex</a>，并使用 AWS 管理的身份验证、账户控制和计费。iOS 版 Remote 还新增了可选的应用内锁、后续操作行为设置、差异视图自动换行，以及通过 SSH 连接 Windows 电脑的功能。桌面应用则在个人资料视图中新增了终端位置控制和活动洞察。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=month-2026-06\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 2026 年 6 月的全部发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>OpenAI 模型和 Codex，现在可用于你的 AWS 工作流程。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2061564710173224985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-06-01）</p> <p><a id=\"may-2529-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-5-2529\">2026 年 5 月 25–29 日</h2> <p><a id=\"use-windows-apps-and-control-codex-remotely\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"windows-codex\">使用 Windows 应用并远程控制 Codex</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c?anchor=windows-foreground-use\">计算机使用</a>新增了查看、点击和输入 Windows 桌面应用的支持。开始前请安装 Computer Use 插件。在 Windows 上，Codex 会使用当前活动桌面，并在任务运行期间占用前台。远程连接也支持 Windows。在 ChatGPT 移动应用中打开 <strong>Remote</strong>，即可在 Windows 设备上开始工作；你也可以使用运行 ChatGPT 桌面应用的 Mac，并从其他地方查看进度。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Computer to open the Windows app, reproduce the export failure, save a diagnostic file, and summarize the exact steps that trigger the problem.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">使用 @Computer 打开 Windows 应用，复现导出失败，保存诊断文件，并总结触发问题的准确步骤。</div></div> <p>iOS 版 Remote 还新增了 Spotlight 和 Shortcuts 入口、已归档聊天浏览、<code>/side</code> 命令，以及保存或复制渲染图像的选项。桌面应用则新增了本地项目和工作树的聊天协作、按聊天内容和分支名称搜索历史聊天，以及后台子智能体一致的视觉标识。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-25-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">5 月 25 日 iOS 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-28-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">5 月 29 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MPIAB-8VmCo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：Windows 计算机使用和 Codex 移动端访问（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"may-1822-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-5-1822\">2026 年 5 月 18–22 日</h2> <p><a id=\"give-codex-context-from-any-mac-app-with-appshots\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"appshots-mac-codex\">使用 Appshots 将任意 Mac 应用的上下文带给 Codex</h3> <p>按下两个 Command 键时，<a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a>会将当前最前方应用窗口的屏幕截图和可用文本发送给 Codex。这样，Codex 无需你复制、粘贴或描述屏幕内容，就能从设计工具、仪表板、文档及其他应用中获得工作上下文。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use this appshot as the visual reference. Match the selected screen in the app, then open a preview and compare spacing, typography, and color.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">以这张 appshot（应用截图）作为视觉参考。在应用中还原所选界面，然后打开预览，比较间距、字体排版和颜色。</div></div> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QKYbGCvNpFo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 Codex 中的 Appshots（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"follow-long-running-goals\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_30\">跟进长时间运行的目标</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">目标模式</a>已结束实验阶段，现在可在 Codex 应用、IDE 扩展和 CLI 中用于可能持续数小时或数天的目标。<a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c?anchor=locked-use\">锁定状态下使用</a>允许 Codex 在 Mac 锁定后继续执行已批准的计算机使用任务，也可通过 ChatGPT 移动应用中的 <strong>Remote</strong> 使用。ChatGPT Business 工作区还可以<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/plugins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">与工作区成员共享可复用的插件包</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-21\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 5 月 21 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rgh0hMYPcd0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：在 Codex 中使用目标运行长任务（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"may-1115-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-5-1115\">2026 年 5 月 11–15 日</h2> <p><a id=\"continue-desktop-work-from-mobile\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_31\">从移动设备继续桌面工作</h3> <p>ChatGPT 移动应用中的 <strong>Remote</strong> 可以连接到运行 ChatGPT 桌面应用的 Mac。由于工作实际运行在已连接的主机上，你从手机继续操作时，项目、文件、凭据、插件、技能和配置仍然可用。请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">远程连接</a>，设置主机并从另一台设备接续工作。</p> <blockquote> <p>现已进入预览：ChatGPT 移动应用中的 Codex。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2055016850849993072\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-05-14）</p> <p><a id=\"automate-trusted-workflows\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_32\">自动化可信工作流程</h3> <p>Hooks 已全面开放，可在智能体生命周期中的关键节点运行自定义命令。ChatGPT Enterprise 管理员还可以为可信脚本、调度程序和私有 CI 运行器启用 <a href=\"#/article/a-f5bc151215cdfb88\">Codex 访问令牌</a>。Enterprise 指南也扩展了 Codex 的托管设置和控制说明。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-13-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 5 月 14 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>Codex 正变得更易于围绕你的代码进行自动化和定制。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2055032115964870838\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-05-14）</p> <p><a id=\"may-48-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-5-48\">2026 年 5 月 4–8 日</h2> <p><a id=\"work-across-browser-tabs-with-the-chrome-extension\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"chrome\">使用 Chrome 扩展跨浏览器标签页工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Chrome 扩展</a>可以在后台并行处理多个标签页，而不会接管你的浏览器。你可以控制 Codex 可以访问哪些网站，因此很适合在一个任务中结合多个 Web 应用进行研究、数据录入和验证。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare the open product pages, collect the plan limits in a table, cite each source tab, and flag any differences that need a manual check.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">比较当前打开的产品页面，将各套餐的限制整理成表格，引用每个来源标签页，并标出需要人工核查的差异。</div></div> <p>Codex 应用还新增了听写文本清理功能，以及用于姓名、文件路径和代码符号的自定义词典。ChatGPT Enterprise 工作区所有者可以允许成员创建 <a href=\"#/article/a-f5bc151215cdfb88\">Codex 访问令牌</a>，用于可信的非交互式本地工作流程。</p> <p>请阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-05-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">5 月 5 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-05\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">5 月 5 日访问令牌发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-07\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex for Chrome 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6Mxcv1pyBU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：Codex 现在可以直接在 macOS 和 Windows 上使用 Chrome（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"april-2024-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-4-2024\">2026 年 4 月 20–24 日</h2> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-55-for-complex-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-55_1\">使用 GPT-5.5 处理复杂工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">GPT-5.5</a>已加入 Codex，并成为大多数任务的推荐模型，擅长实现、调试、测试、计算机使用、研究，以及生成完善的知识工作成果。</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blGtYq9mL18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 GPT-5.5（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"let-codex-operate-the-browser-and-review-approvals\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex_1\">让 Codex 操作浏览器并审查审批请求</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-computer-use-in-the-browser\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">在内置浏览器中使用计算机（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>，Codex 可以点击本地开发服务器和基于文件的页面，复现问题并验证修复。符合条件的审批请求还可以通过<a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">自动审批审查</a>处理；操作运行前会显示审查状态和风险。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Browser to open the local app, reproduce the checkout failure, fix it, and verify the flow end to end.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">使用 @Browser 打开本地应用，复现结账失败，修复问题，并从头到尾验证该流程。</div></div> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-23\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 4 月 23 日发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>借助 GPT-5.5，Codex 现在可以通过浏览器、文件、文档和电脑完成更多工作。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2047381283358355706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-04-23）</p> <p><a id=\"april-1317-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-4-1317\">2026 年 4 月 13–17 日</h2> <p><a id=\"preview-and-operate-work-in-one-place\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_33\">在一个地方预览并操作工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">内置浏览器</a>新增实时预览和页面评论；<a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">计算机使用</a>则让 Codex 能查看并操作 macOS 应用。两者结合后，视觉实现和端到端验证都可以与代码修改放在同一项任务中完成。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用中打开的本地网页</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lm7-yFZ5fZQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：Codex 几乎可以处理所有事情（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"start-with-a-task-and-keep-it-moving\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"start-with-a-chat-and-keep-it-moving\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_34\">从聊天开始并持续推进工作</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=start-without-a-project\">独立聊天</a>让你无需先选择项目文件夹即可开始工作。同一版本还新增了<a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?anchor=schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\">在聊天中创建定时任务</a>、拉取请求上下文、更丰富的文件预览，以及可用于跨聊天工作的<a href=\"#/article/a-7ea5a1f5cc6a25bc\">记忆</a>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-16-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">阅读 4 月 16 日 Codex 应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>自动化现在可以在同一线程中运行，因此 Codex 可以从上次停下的地方继续。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2044828148890812538\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAI（需联网）</a>（2026-04-16）</p> <p><a id=\"april-610-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-4-610\">2026 年 4 月 6–10 日</h2> <p><a id=\"review-and-ship-pull-requests-in-the-app\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_35\">在应用中审查并发布拉取请求</h3> <p>审查体验新增了可折叠的行内评论、行内和独立审查模式，并让 Git 与源代码上下文更加清晰。之后，拉取请求活动、评论和推送选项也并入应用，同时新增工作区文件标签页；你无需切换工具，就能检查变更并作出回应。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-09-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">4 月 9 日</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-10-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">4 月 10 日</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>的 Codex 应用发布说明，或了解如何<a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">在应用中审查变更</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"march-2327-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-3-2327\">2026 年 3 月 23–27 日</h2> <p><a id=\"package-workflows-as-plugins\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_36\">将工作流程打包为插件</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a>以可安装的软件包形式推出，其中包含技能、连接器和 MCP 服务器。这让完整工作流程更容易被发现、安装和分享；重新设计的插件与技能页面也更清晰地展示了内容和状态。本周还新增了搜索过往聊天的功能。</p> <p>请阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-24-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">任务搜索</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-25\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">插件发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-25-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex 应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>Codex 插件？我们为你准备好了。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2037604273434018259\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-03-27）</p> <p><a id=\"march-1620-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-3-1620\">2026 年 3 月 16–20 日</h2> <p><a id=\"branch-earlier-and-choose-tools-from-the-composer\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_37\">从较早的位置创建分支，并在编辑框中选择工具</h3> <p>你可以从聊天中较早的一条消息创建分支，从而尝试新方案，同时保留原来的路径。起草消息时即可使用模型和推理命令；启用的技能会显示在 <code>@</code> 菜单中；GPT-5.4 mini 则为轻量任务和子智能体提供了更快的选择。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-17\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">GPT-5.4 mini</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-18-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">聊天控制</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-19-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">技能菜单</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>的发布说明。</p> <blockquote> <p>GPT-5.4 mini 比 GPT-5 mini 快两倍以上，针对编码、计算机使用、多模态理解和子智能体进行了优化。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2033953815834333608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-03-17）</p> <p><a id=\"march-913-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-3-913\">2026 年 3 月 9–13 日</h2> <p><a id=\"schedule-work-with-the-right-environment\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_38\">在合适的环境中安排任务</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a>可以在本地或工作树中运行，并可明确指定模型和推理级别。可复用模板让常见任务的配置更快捷，自定义主题则让工作区更容易按个人喜好调整。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用中的定时任务设置</p> <p>自动化现已正式全面开放（GA）。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2032222711032971548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-03-12）</p> <p><a id=\"let-codex-inspect-terminal-output\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex_2\">让 Codex 检查终端输出</h3> <p>Codex 还学会了读取当前聊天对应的<a href=\"#/article/a-3903992afce071c2?anchor=run-and-validate-your-project\">集成终端</a>。它可以直接检查运行中的开发服务器或构建输出，而不必让你复制粘贴这些内容。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every weekday, inspect changes from the last 24 hours, find one likely regression, fix it in a worktree, run the smallest relevant tests, and report the evidence.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">每个工作日检查过去 24 小时的更改，找出一个可能的回归问题，在工作树中修复，运行最小范围的相关测试，并报告证据。</div></div> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">3 月 11 日</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-12-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">3 月 12 日</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>的 Codex 应用发布说明。</p> <p><a id=\"march-26-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-3-26\">2026 年 3 月 2–6 日</h2> <p><a id=\"run-codex-natively-on-windows\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"windows-codex_1\">在 Windows 上原生运行 Codex</h3> <p>Codex 应用现已在 <a href=\"#/article/a-ce14d03dc374424b\">Windows</a>上发布，支持原生 PowerShell 和沙箱，以及工作树、定时任务和技能。偏好 Linux 环境的开发者仍可使用 WSL。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：在 Windows 上原生运行的 Codex 应用</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hNcRChDrNk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：Codex 应用现已登陆 Windows（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"move-tasks-between-local-and-worktree\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"move-chats-between-local-and-worktree\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"local-worktree\">在 Local 和 Worktree 之间迁移聊天</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306?anchor=working-between-local-and-worktree\">Local 与 Worktree 交接</a>让你可以在保留上下文的同时迁移正在进行的聊天。那一周 GPT-5.4 也加入了 Codex，适用于编码、计算机使用和需要更长上下文的工作流程。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-04-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Windows 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>、<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-03-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">工作树交接说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-05\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">GPT-5.4 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"february-913-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-2-913\">2026 年 2 月 9–13 日</h2> <p><a id=\"iterate-in-real-time-and-branch-an-approach\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_39\">实时迭代，并为方案创建分支</h3> <p>GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark 以研究预览版形式推出，是一款近乎即时响应、适合实时编码迭代的模型。应用还新增了聊天分支和始终置顶的悬浮聊天窗口，方便你尝试另一种方案，或将 Codex 放在编辑器或浏览器旁边。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-12\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Spark 发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-12-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex 应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>，或参阅当前的<a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">模型指南</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>介绍 GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark：专为实时编码打造的超高速模型。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2022009906329739681\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 X 上查看 @OpenAIDevs（需联网）</a>（2026-02-12）</p> <p><a id=\"february-26-2026\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"2026-2-26\">2026 年 2 月 2–6 日</h2> <p><a id=\"the-codex-app-launches-on-macos\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-macos\">Codex 应用在 macOS 上发布</h3> <p>Codex 应用作为桌面工作区在 macOS 上发布，支持并行项目聊天、内置 Git 审查、工作树、技能、定时任务和语音听写。这些能力现在都已集成到<a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT 桌面应用</a>中的 Codex。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：最初的 macOS Codex 应用，展示并行项目聊天</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HFM3se4lNiw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">观看：介绍 Codex 应用（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"steer-active-work-and-add-files\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_40\">调整进行中的工作并添加文件</h3> <p>在回复进行期间调整方向，让你无需停止当前响应就能引导 Codex 转向；文件附件支持的类型也从图像扩展到了其他文件。这些做法后来成为使用所需上下文<a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=steering-and-queuing\">调整后续指令及其排队顺序</a>的基础。</p> <p>请阅读 <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-02\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex 应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-05-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">2 月 5 日应用发布说明</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> <aside>     2026-10-18  </aside>","en":"<h1 id=\"whats-new\">What's new</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>For every versioned update, bug fix, and minor improvement, see the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">ChatGPT and Codex changelog (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/changelog.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API changelog</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"october-1216-2026\">October 12–16, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"open-your-dot-from-ios-widgets-and-shortcuts\">Open your dot from iOS widgets and Shortcuts</h3> <p>Add the <strong>Your dot</strong> Home Screen widget to open your conversation, with optional message and call buttons. In Apple Shortcuts, use <strong>Open your dot</strong> with <strong>Messaging</strong>, <strong>Dictation</strong>, or <strong>Call</strong> mode. You can assign a saved shortcut to your iPhone's Action button on supported models.</p> <p>These features are rolling out with ChatGPT for iOS 1.2026.279 and require <a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">dot access</a>. <a href=\"#/article/a-4b4aabd54f9e5c9c?anchor=ios-widgets-and-shortcuts\">Set up widgets and shortcuts</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"october-59-2026\"><a href=\"#/article/a-e50abb55fbf87aa6\">October 5–9, 2026</a></h2> <h3 id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b1af804010bca37b\">Create your dot in the ChatGPT mobile app</a></h3> <p>Create your dot, give it a name, customize its appearance, and connect plugins from your phone. This week's Dots update also brings more context from ChatGPT and Codex, faster cloud browsing, and fixes to notifications, setup, and everyday use.</p> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-61-sol-with-ultrafast-mode\">Use GPT-6.1 Sol with Ultrafast mode</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</a> speeds up token generation with GPT-6.1 Sol in Codex and ChatGPT Work. Ultrafast is available on Pro $500 and eligible Enterprise and Edu plans.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-e50abb55fbf87aa6\">Read the full update →</a></p> <h2 id=\"devday-2026\"><a href=\"#/article/a-f45de159970ea06a\">DevDay 2026</a></h2> <p><a id=\"devday-roundup-title\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"meet-your-dot\">Meet your dot</h3> <p>Give your dot ongoing responsibility. Dots keep making progress between conversations and are rolling out gradually to eligible accounts.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">Meet your dot</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">Availability</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-8b62a89b49b84e46\">Admin guide</a></p> <h3 id=\"work-across-devices\">Work across devices</h3> <p>Start a synced Work task on desktop and continue on web or mobile.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c7688c996bc9669?anchor=continue-work-across-devices\">Get started with Work</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">Set up sync</a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-space\">ChatGPT Space</h3> <p>Bring files and Pages together, and work with collaborators.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8\">Get started</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">Work with the agent</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b\">Collaboration</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-315e17f0f4b919c1\">Admin guide</a></p> <h3 id=\"astra-ultrafast-in-codex\">Astra Ultrafast in Codex</h3> <p>Faster responses in Codex and Work on Pro $500 and eligible Enterprise and Edu plans.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Plans and usage</a></p> <h3 id=\"reusable-cloud-environments\">Reusable cloud environments</h3> <p>Prepare a development setup once and reuse it in isolated cloud workspaces.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">Cloud environments</a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-security-cloud\">Codex Security Cloud</h3> <p>Scan repositories, review findings, and prepare patches in research preview.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">Set up Security Cloud</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-0c53ef5188800731\">Threat model</a></p> <h3 id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt\">Sign in with ChatGPT</h3> <p>Offer ChatGPT sign-in and eligible ChatGPT plan usage in your app. Commercial sign-in is in a limited trial with selected partners.</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/quickstart.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Quickstart</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/token-sharing-open-source.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open-source apps</a></p> <h3 id=\"sites-with-connected-data\">Sites with connected data</h3> <p>Build workspace-private Sites with each visitor’s connected apps, where enabled.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=load-visitor-data-via-plugins\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Build with plugins (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=control-access-and-secrets\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Sharing and access (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> <h3 id=\"plugin-extensions\">Plugin Extensions</h3> <p>Add sidebar apps, panels, editors, and forms to ChatGPT. Composer mentions require the desktop app; Free and Go web extensions are coming soon.</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/extensions.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build extensions</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/plugins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Package a plugin</a></p> <h3 id=\"mcp-events\">MCP Events</h3> <p>Let users ask ChatGPT to act on updates from your MCP server. Requires MCP 2.0 and webhook delivery.</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/mcp-events.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build event subscriptions</a></p> <h3 id=\"website-annotations\">Website annotations</h3> <p>Add context and preview controls to feedback from supported desktop browsers.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Annotations Extensibility</a></p> <h3 id=\"gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</h3> <p>Use GPT-6.1 Sol for complex coding and professional work in the API and Codex, where available.</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API model</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">Codex availability</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/responses-multi-agent.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Multi-agent beta</a></p> <h3 id=\"astra-ultrafast-in-the-api\">Astra Ultrafast in the API</h3> <p>Generate output tokens faster in the Responses API, subject to availability.</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/ultrafast-mode.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ultrafast guide</a> <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing?latest-pricing=ultrafast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pricing (not in this local snapshot)</a></p> <h3 id=\"chatgpt-in-slack-and-teams\">ChatGPT in Slack and Teams</h3> <p>Bring ChatGPT and approved tools into Slack and Teams conversations.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-6be952b78a5da779\">Slack and Teams guide</a></p> <h3 id=\"team-tasks\">Team Tasks</h3> <p>Run scheduled or event-triggered work through a team’s service account and approved connections.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-81de09346a07fee6\">Set up Team Tasks</a></p> <h3 id=\"workspace-connections\">Workspace connections</h3> <p>Connect company-managed accounts for supported teams and workflows.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d409bf3c6a23c7d1\">Manage shared connections</a></p> <h3 id=\"agent-security\">Agent Security</h3> <p>Manage tool, file, and network access for local and cloud agents.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-dccd5924f08b9ad8\">Agent Security</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-77481efb12a63f4e\">Managed configuration</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">Work sync</a></p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-f45de159970ea06a\">Read the full update →</a></p> <h2 id=\"september-28october-2-2026\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b9b242960e2269f3\">September 28–October 2, 2026</a></h2> <h3 id=\"choose-gpt-61-sol-for-complex-work\">Choose GPT-6.1 Sol for complex work</h3> <p>Use <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</a> for coding and professional work at a lower cost than Astra. Access depends on your plan, client, and workspace settings.</p> <h3 id=\"delegate-ongoing-work-to-your-dot\">Delegate ongoing work to your dot</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">Dots</a> continue work between conversations and bring back results for review. <a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b?anchor=access\">Access is rolling out gradually</a> to eligible accounts.</p> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-6-astra-ultrafast\">Use GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast</a> speeds up token generation in Codex and Work on Pro $500 and eligible Enterprise and Edu plans. Usage and workspace restrictions apply.</p> <h3 id=\"prepare-reusable-codex-cloud-environments\">Prepare reusable Codex Cloud environments</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">Prepare and publish a cloud environment</a> once, then reuse its filesystem in isolated workspaces for new tasks.</p> <h3 id=\"scan-repositories-with-codex-security-cloud\">Scan repositories with Codex Security Cloud</h3> <p>Install the <a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">Security Cloud plugin</a> to scan connected repositories and review findings and patches. Available in research preview to workspaces with access.</p> <h3 id=\"continue-work-across-devices\">Continue Work across devices</h3> <p>With <a href=\"#/article/a-d50d47c21e8fd4ad\">Local computer access with Work Cloud</a> enabled, continue eligible tasks from desktop, web, or mobile. Keep your computer online for steps that need its local resources.</p> <h3 id=\"work-together-in-chatgpt-space\">Work together in ChatGPT Space</h3> <p>Create and share <a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages in Space</a>. Mention ChatGPT or your dot and use <a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">slash commands</a> while editing.</p> <h3 id=\"set-up-shared-team-workflows\">Set up shared team workflows</h3> <p>Run scheduled or event-triggered <a href=\"#/article/a-81de09346a07fee6\">Team Tasks</a> with a service account and approved workspace connections. Admins also manage <a href=\"#/article/a-6be952b78a5da779\">ChatGPT access in Slack and Teams</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"sign-in-to-apps-with-chatgpt\">Sign in to apps with ChatGPT</h3> <p>Add <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc/quickstart.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT sign-in and eligible plan usage</a> to your app. Commercial sign-in is in a limited trial; plan usage supports open-source partners and selected private clients.</p> <h3 id=\"extend-your-plugins-interface\">Extend your plugin's interface</h3> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/extensions.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plugin Extensions</a> add interfaces to ChatGPT. Composer mentions are desktop-only, and Free and Go web extensions are coming soon.</p> <h3 id=\"respond-to-mcp-events\">Respond to MCP events</h3> <p>Build <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/mcp-events.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">webhook subscriptions</a> so users can ask ChatGPT to act on updates from your MCP server. Requires MCP 2.0.</p> <h3 id=\"customize-website-annotations\">Customize website annotations</h3> <p>Use the <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Browser Annotation API</a> to attach context and preview controls to website feedback in supported desktop browsers.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b9b242960e2269f3\">Read the full update →</a></p> <h2 id=\"september-2125-2026\">September 21–25, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"choose-gpt-6-sol-and-luna\">Choose GPT-6 Sol and Luna</h3> <p>GPT-6 Sol and GPT-6 Luna are rolling out in Codex at lower token prices than their GPT-5.6 predecessors. Start with <strong>Sol Medium</strong> for everyday and complex coding, or <strong>Luna High</strong> for focused, repeatable tasks. Availability depends on your plan, client, and workspace settings.</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">Models</a> for model selection, <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Pricing</a> for usage and credit rates, and the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-22-gpt-6-sol-luna\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">launch announcement</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> for availability details.</p> <h2 id=\"september-1418-2026\">September 14–18, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"prepare-for-gpt-55-retirement\">Prepare for GPT-5.5 retirement</h3> <p>GPT-5.5 will retire from ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, and Codex on October 14, 2026, across all plans. The OpenAI API isn't affected.</p> <p>For Codex with ChatGPT sign-in, choose an available replacement for your plan and client. See <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-55-retirement\">GPT-5.5 retirement</a> for migration guidance. Update saved model settings, workspace defaults, custom agents, scheduled tasks, and scripts that still select GPT-5.5 before the retirement date. <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-14-gpt-55-retirement\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the retirement notice</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> for details.</p> <h2 id=\"september-711-2026\">September 7–11, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"start-a-quick-chat-from-your-pet\">Start a quick chat from your pet</h3> <p>Type a request or start a voice conversation from the floating <a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets controls</a> in the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS and Windows. Keep working in another app while you follow progress, then open the full conversation when you need it.</p> <p>Choose a companion in <strong>Settings &gt; Pets</strong>, or select <strong>Mini</strong> to use the controls without a pet. Press <strong>Option+Space</strong> on macOS or <strong>Windows+Alt+P</strong> on Windows to show the controls and focus Quick Chat. Use <code>@</code> to add context and <code>$</code> to choose a skill, then press <strong>Enter</strong> to send your request.</p> <h3 id=\"share-an-app-window-on-windows\">Share an app window on Windows</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a> bring a screenshot and available text from the frontmost Windows app into ChatGPT. Press both <strong>Alt</strong> keys at the same time, then ask a question about the window or describe what you want to do. Windows Appshots open in the main ChatGPT app.</p> <p>On macOS, Appshots can also start a new chat in the floating Pets controls when they're visible and the main ChatGPT window is in the background. Set <strong>Appshot destination</strong> to <strong>Automatic</strong> and authorize Appshots permissions in the main app first.</p> <p>Update the desktop app to use these features. Availability depends on rollout and workspace settings.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-09-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the September 11 release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> for the full update and smaller improvements.</p> <h2 id=\"august-31september-4-2026\">August 31–September 4, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"take-on-demanding-work-with-gpt-6-astra\">Take on demanding work with GPT-6 Astra</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-6-astra\">GPT-6 Astra</a> combines advanced reasoning, computer use, and stronger judgment for complex work across code, apps, and research in Codex and ChatGPT Work. Use it to carry out a workflow, check the result, and produce a document, spreadsheet, or presentation that fits your templates and task.</p> <p>Once Astra is available to your account, choose it from the model selector. See <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">usage and pricing</a> before starting a large task. Enterprise access requires both rollout eligibility and an administrator to enable it.</p> <h2 id=\"august-2428-2026\">August 24–28, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"work-with-more-websites\">Work with more websites</h3> <ul> <li> <p><strong>Use your browser:</strong> Work in <a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Edge, Brave, Opera, or Vivaldi</a> as well as Chrome from the ChatGPT desktop app. Bring an open tab into a ChatGPT Work or Codex chat and work with the website where you're already signed in. Opera supports browser control but doesn't have side chat.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Use a website's tools:</strong> With <a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">Site tools (WebMCP)</a>, ChatGPT Work and Codex can use actions offered by a website in the desktop app's built-in browser. For example, a document editor can provide tools to find a section or add a comment. Update the desktop app and use GPT-5.6 Sol or GPT-5.6 Terra. Site tools aren't available with GPT-5.6 Luna or in Enterprise or Edu workspaces.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Sign in through the cloud browser:</strong> On eligible plans, continue a task that needs a website account in ChatGPT Work on the web, iOS, or Android. Follow the <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=web-sign-in-to-a-website\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">sign-in request (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> and enter your details in the sign-in flow, not in the chat. This doesn't connect your local browser profile. Website sign-in isn't available for Enterprise or Edu workspaces.</p> </li> </ul> <p>Availability depends on rollout and workspace settings.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Edge to read the current page and turn it into a concise checklist.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-25-browser\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 25 browser release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"run-scheduled-tasks-from-app-events\">Run scheduled tasks from app events</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?sectionMissing=web-trigger-tasks-from-app-events\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Scheduled tasks (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> can now start when a supported event occurs in Gmail, Slack, or GitHub. Use an event trigger to triage new email, summarize channel activity, or act on pull request feedback without polling on a fixed cadence.</p> <p>Event-triggered tasks are available in ChatGPT on the web and mobile for eligible plans. Connect the relevant app and approve its requested access first. In managed workspaces, administrators can control access.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">When one of my pull requests in &lt;owner&gt;/&lt;repository&gt; receives new review feedback, summarize the feedback and prepare a revision plan.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-25-event-triggers\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 25 release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"august-1721-2026\">August 17–21, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"work-with-more-of-your-apps-and-content\">Work with more of your apps and content</h3> <ul> <li> <p><strong>Apple Messages:</strong> <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a?sectionMissing=app-use-apple-messages-from-codex\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Find chats, summarize messages, prepare replies, and send through Messages on your Mac (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>. The plugin is available on all plans in the ChatGPT desktop app for macOS. Use it in ChatGPT Work and Codex, not in regular ChatGPT chats. By default, ChatGPT sends messages only after you approve the message and its recipients.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Site co-editing:</strong> Where available, <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=collaborate-on-a-site\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">invite active members of your workspace as editors (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>. Editors can refine the Site and publish updates after its owner publishes it for the first time. Invited editors can read the Site's live database data; owners retain control of sharing and settings.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Editable Site URLs:</strong> Where available, <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6?sectionMissing=change-a-site-url\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">choose a new ChatGPT-hosted address for an existing Site (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> without redeploying it. The previous address redirects to the new one.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Computer History in Europe:</strong> Use <a href=\"#/article/a-f3a0216fc3d2956b\">Computer History</a> in the EEA, Switzerland, and the United Kingdom. It remains off by default for ChatGPT Pro, Business, and Enterprise users on macOS. Business and Enterprise administrators must enable access first.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Shared thread snapshots:</strong> <a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f?anchor=share-a-read-only-snapshot-of-a-codex-thread\">Share a read-only snapshot of a local Codex thread</a> from the ChatGPT desktop app for macOS. Personal-account links are viewable by anyone with the link; workspace-account links are limited to the originating workspace. Codex redacts known secret patterns, but review the snapshot before sharing because sensitive content may remain.</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>Unified pinned threads:</strong> Keep your <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?sectionMissing=app-organize-projects-and-chats\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">pinned chats (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> in sync between desktop and iOS.</p> </li> </ul> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Find the latest Messages conversation about tomorrow's launch, summarize the open questions, and draft a reply without sending it.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-20-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 20 release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Shared threads in Codex and ChatGPT Work let you show the process behind your build with a read-only link</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2090555241343418814\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-08-20)</p> <h3 id=\"work-with-gitlab-projects-in-codex-cloud\">Work with GitLab projects in Codex cloud</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-e0c9ac1b89ddeeb2\">GitLab support</a> is available in beta on all ChatGPT plans. Connect a project, create a cloud environment, start tasks from issues or merge requests with <code>@codex</code>, and request one-off or automatic merge request reviews.</p> <p>The integration runs in Codex cloud, and a managed workspace admin can disable it. GitLab-triggered activity requires permission to configure the applicable webhook. GitLab Self-Managed and GitLab Dedicated connections require workspace admin setup; webhook activity requires GitLab 19.0 or later.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-19-gitlab\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 19 GitLab release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"export-public-plugin-metadata-for-review\">Export public plugin metadata for review</h3> <p>Eligible ChatGPT Enterprise workspace owners and admins can download a CSV of the public plugins visible to their workspace. In <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/admin/plugins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Admin &gt; Plugins (online)</a>, select <strong>Public</strong>, then select the download icon (<strong>Export CSV</strong>).</p> <p>The export lists plugin, app, and Chat skill names and descriptions, together with developer, version, date added in UTC, and OpenAI verification metadata. It uses a public-catalog snapshot that can be up to 48 hours old and excludes plugins created for the workspace. The export isn't available in FedRAMP workspaces.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-17-admin-csv\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 17 admin export release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"august-1014-2026\">August 10–14, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"find-earlier-work-with-computer-history\">Find earlier work with Computer History</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-f3a0216fc3d2956b\">Computer History</a> turns activity across your apps and websites into a searchable timeline and memories that ChatGPT and Codex can use. Turn it on only if you want to share that context, then choose which apps and websites contribute, pause collection, and review or delete your history at any time.</p> <p>Computer History is available in the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS for ChatGPT Pro, Business, and Enterprise customers. Business and Enterprise administrators must first enable access. Initial availability excludes the European Union, Switzerland, and the United Kingdom.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Find the document and Slack thread I was reviewing earlier, then summarize the decisions I still need to act on.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W-HhMUe9hOg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Computer History in ChatGPT (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"use-the-chatgpt-desktop-app-on-linux\">Use the ChatGPT desktop app on Linux</h3> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">ChatGPT desktop app for Linux</a> is now available in preview. Install a <code>.deb</code> package on supported Ubuntu or Debian distributions, or an <code>.rpm</code> package on Fedora. Packages are available for both x64 and ARM64 processors.</p> <p>Sign in with your ChatGPT account to work with projects, local files, and Codex. Some features, including Computer Use, aren't yet available in the Linux preview.</p> <blockquote> <p>Now in preview: The ChatGPT desktop app for Linux.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2087231350134980830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-08-11)</p> <h3 id=\"bring-your-existing-agent-setup-and-work-with-you\">Bring your existing agent setup and work with you</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\">Import instructions, settings, skills, plugins, projects, and recent work</a> from <strong>Claude Code</strong>, <strong>Claude Cowork</strong>, or <strong>Cursor</strong> into the ChatGPT desktop app. Turn on automatic updates in <strong>Settings &gt; Import</strong> to keep your imported work in sync.</p> <p>In Codex CLI, use <code>/import</code> to bring supported setup and recent chats from Claude Code or Cursor into your local session.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 11 desktop and CLI release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>You can now keep your work from other agents in sync with ChatGPT Work and Codex.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2087242829076791392\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-08-11)</p> <h3 id=\"choose-the-right-access-for-defensive-security-work\">Choose the right access for defensive security work</h3> <p>Daybreak now offers two tiers for approved defenders. <strong>Daybreak Blue</strong> supports general defensive work, such as secure code review, incident response, and patch validation. <strong>Daybreak Red</strong> requires its own approval and provides access to purpose-trained models for authorized security assessments.</p> <p>Access requires <a href=\"#/article/a-04f6dcc4a4fe6044?anchor=trusted-access-for-cyber\">Trusted Access for Cyber</a> and applies only to the approved identity, workspace or organization, model, and product surface.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-08-10-daybreak\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the August 10 Daybreak announcement</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>We’re expanding our cybersecurity initiative Daybreak</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2086864365379010729\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-08-10)</p> <h2 id=\"august-37-2026\">August 3–7, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"talk-through-files-and-projects-with-chatgpt-voice\">Talk through files and projects with ChatGPT Voice</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT Voice</a> now supports uploaded files and <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">ChatGPT Projects</a>. Ask questions about a document during a voice conversation, or continue a project using its recent chats, sources, and instructions.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the research brief I uploaded, explain the main tradeoffs out loud, and compare them with the sources already in this project.\n</code></pre> <h3 id=\"study-and-teach-with-dedicated-education-plugins\">Study and teach with dedicated education plugins</h3> <p>Three new <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">plugins</a> bring classroom-specific workflows to ChatGPT Work and Codex. <strong>College Student</strong> creates study guides, practice quizzes, flashcards, and interactive explanations. <strong>College Educator</strong> helps develop course plans, materials, and assessments. <strong>K–12 Educator</strong> supports lesson planning, classroom resources, and materials adapted for different learners.</p> <p>The plugins are available through ChatGPT Edu and ChatGPT for Teachers district deployments. Schools control which tools and permissions are available. Read the <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/learn-teach-chatgpt-work-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">education plugins announcement (online)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"reuse-saved-files-and-find-past-work-faster\">Reuse saved files and find past work faster</h3> <p>On the web, add a saved Library file to a conversation without uploading it again, search within Library, and paste formatted text without losing headings, links, or lists. Search also matches folders and conversation titles across the web, iOS, and Android.</p> <p>Pastes longer than 10,000 characters now become attachments on every ChatGPT plan, including Enterprise and Edu. Select <strong>Show in text field</strong> if you want to move the content back into your message.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT release notes (online)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"see-your-remaining-chatgpt-work-usage\">See your remaining ChatGPT Work usage</h3> <p>Eligible users on personal plans and ChatGPT Business can check their remaining ChatGPT Work usage directly in the web sidebar. Available credit options depend on your account and workspace permissions. ChatGPT Work and Codex continue to share the same <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">usage limits and credits</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"choose-how-gpt-56-responds-in-chatgpt\">Choose how GPT-5.6 responds in ChatGPT</h3> <p>ChatGPT Plus and Pro users can adjust how much thought GPT-5.6 Sol puts into a response with a new slider. The updated model also provides more reliable facts and focused answers. GPT-5.6 Luna becomes the default ChatGPT model on the Free and Go plans.</p> <p>These changes apply to ChatGPT conversations. They don't change model behavior in ChatGPT Work or Codex. Read the <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT release notes (online)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"organize-work-and-switch-agents-in-codex-cli-01470\">Organize work and switch agents in Codex CLI 0.147.0</h3> <p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.147.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex CLI 0.147.0 (online)</a> adds persistent, manually ordered chat sections and portable Agent Plugins. Search across local, personal, workspace, and remote plugin catalogs, or <a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\">import Cursor and Claude Code setup</a> without duplicating synced conversations.</p> <p>Use <code>--approve-for-me</code> to enable <a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">automatic approval review</a> for eligible requests without expanding filesystem or network permissions. Amazon Bedrock sessions also gain cached web search and remote conversation compaction.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UaeWJK_vv-Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing Agent Plugins (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"follow-and-resume-deeper-security-scans\">Follow and resume deeper security scans</h3> <p>Hosted Codex Security plugin versions <code>0.1.16</code> through <code>0.1.18</code> add live scan progress, measured token usage, resumable deep scans, and configurable discovery limits. The latest release also supports Amazon Bedrock authentication for repository scans and their delegated workers.</p> <p>Use the <a href=\"#/article/a-8486fe00c240100d\">Codex Security workbench</a> to review scan progress and findings, or <a href=\"#/article/a-03d337741f7199f7\">configure a deep scan</a> when you need a more thorough assessment. Check the <a href=\"#/article/a-796d8353993fb17e\">plugin changelog</a> to confirm which features your installed version supports.</p> <h3 id=\"review-github-pull-requests-for-security-risks\">Review GitHub pull requests for security risks</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-862c857e0358aa15\">Codex Security Review</a> analyzes pull-request changes alongside repository context, threat models, and security guidance. Configure automatic reviews when a pull request opens or receives new commits, or request one directly with <code>@codex security review</code>.</p> <p>The feature is available in research preview to eligible ChatGPT Enterprise, Business, Edu, and Pro customers. It isn't available on Plus, and usage limits can apply.</p> <blockquote> <p>Now in research preview: Codex Security Review</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2085482310636560830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-08-06)</p> <h2 id=\"july-2731-2026\">July 27–31, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-56-terra-and-luna-at-lower-rates\">Use GPT-5.6 Terra and Luna at lower rates</h3> <p>GPT-5.6 Terra now costs 20% less, and GPT-5.6 Luna costs 80% less. Input, cached input, and output rates decreased by the same proportions. The updated <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">usage limits and rates</a> make Terra a stronger fit for everyday work and Luna especially useful for focused coding and high-volume tasks.</p> <blockquote> <p>Starting today, we are reducing prices for GPT-5.6 Luna by 80% and GPT-5.6 Terra by 20%</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2082878156483219672\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-07-30)</p> <h3 id=\"find-useful-context-across-your-browser-and-open-tabs\">Find useful context across your browser and open tabs</h3> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, the <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">built-in browser</a> can find pages from your browsing history or search Google directly from its address bar. ChatGPT can also search your browsing history when a task needs earlier context.</p> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Chrome extension</a> lets you mention open tabs, bring selected page text into a side chat, ask questions about YouTube videos, or select <strong>Ask ChatGPT</strong> from a page's context menu. Review and approve requests to use browser history before ChatGPT includes that information in a task.</p> <blockquote> <p>In Side Chat, ask about a YouTube video, reference your open tabs, or highlight text on a page and ask away.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/ChatGPT/status/2082970812584432115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @ChatGPT on X (online)</a> (2026-07-30)</p> <h3 id=\"review-changes-across-repositories\">Review changes across repositories</h3> <p>When a <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=use-local-projects-for-folders-and-codebases\">local project contains more than one folder</a>, the desktop app shows every repository and the lines changed in each one. Select <strong>Review</strong> to inspect their diffs together without switching between separate review views.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the changes across every repository in this project, identify integration risks, and summarize the fixes needed before I open a pull request.\n</code></pre> <h3 id=\"refine-generated-images-in-your-conversation\">Refine generated images in your conversation</h3> <p>Open a generated image in the expanded viewer, then switch between <strong>Focused view</strong> and <strong>Canvas view</strong>. Add comments across images, select the versions you want to keep, and ask for targeted edits without leaving the chat. Learn more about <a href=\"#/article/a-6e5b50840145f8df\">image generation</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>ImageGen in Codex just got a new lightbox and canvas.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2082944138635595782\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-07-30)</p> <h3 id=\"find-chats-that-need-your-attention\">Find chats that need your attention</h3> <p>The desktop app's new <strong>Activity view</strong> brings together chats you recently engaged with and work that needs your attention. Select the bell in the sidebar to open the view.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-30-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the July 30 desktop release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>The new Activity view in the ChatGPT desktop app brings together conversations that need your attention</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2083288643310133716\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-07-31)</p> <h3 id=\"connect-partner-tools-with-sign-in-with-chatgpt\">Connect partner tools with Sign in with ChatGPT</h3> <p><strong>Sign in with ChatGPT</strong> is rolling out in beta to supported plugins and partner sites, beginning with Airtable, GitLab, HubSpot, Notion, Supabase, and Vercel. Use it to create or link a partner account with fewer steps, then start working with that service in ChatGPT or Codex.</p> <p>Partners receive only your name, email address, and profile picture when available. Each plugin's requested access still requires a separate review and approval. Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-29\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">July 29 sign-in announcement</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"collaborate-in-a-dedicated-academic-research-workspace\">Collaborate in a dedicated academic research workspace</h3> <p><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-for-academic-researchers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT for Academic Researchers (online)</a> offers eligible faculty and postdoctoral researchers 12 months of complimentary access to a dedicated ChatGPT workspace. Approved teams can include up to five verified researchers from the same institution and receive business data protections and ChatGPT Pro-level usage limits. Participants can use GPT-5.6 across ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, and Codex for research and coding workflows.</p> <p>The program covers ChatGPT access, not OpenAI API credits. Eligibility requires <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001406\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">institutional verification and a qualifying research paper (online)</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLehRytu9Zo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: We're giving 100,000 academic researchers free access to our frontier models (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"continue-codex-tasks-more-reliably-on-ios\">Continue Codex tasks more reliably on iOS</h3> <p>ChatGPT for iOS 1.2026.202 reconnects to tasks more reliably when you return to the app or unlock your device with Face ID. Voice conversations use your chosen ChatGPT voice and show usage-limit warnings, while the composer now suggests installed plugins and their skills consistently with the desktop app.</p> <p>The release also improves pause and resume controls for goals, inline tables and visual themes, large workspace diffs, selected-text references, and model restoration. Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-27-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">July 27 iOS release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"compare-security-scans-and-manage-findings\">Compare security scans and manage findings</h3> <p>Hosted Codex Security plugin releases <code>0.1.14</code> and <code>0.1.15</code> add scan comparisons, false-positive feedback, scoped <code>SECURITY.md</code> policies, and clearer repository and finding histories. You can select findings for tracking in Linear or GitHub Issues, with Codex reviewing the proposed action before you approve it.</p> <p>Use the existing <a href=\"#/article/a-8486fe00c240100d\">Codex Security workbench</a> to review saved scans, findings, repository history, and remediation in the desktop app. The hosted plugin catalog offers version <code>0.1.15</code>, while the public CLI plugin marketplace offers version <code>0.1.11</code>. Check the <a href=\"#/article/a-796d8353993fb17e\">Codex Security plugin changelog</a> before relying on a new feature.</p> <h3 id=\"run-security-scans-from-the-terminal-ci-or-typescript\">Run security scans from the terminal, CI, or TypeScript</h3> <p>The public <code>@openai/codex-security</code> CLI and TypeScript SDK reached version <code>0.1.5</code>, with release numbers separate from the Codex Security plugin. Use the package to <a href=\"#/article/a-1716f9f1a07bca7e\">run scans from the CLI</a>, review pull-request changes and upload SARIF results in <a href=\"#/article/a-8d926b82884d5f99\">CI</a>, or run resumable <a href=\"#/article/a-0462b3e291010c32\">bulk scans</a> across GitHub repositories or a pinned CSV inventory.</p> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-13b97f7316a6bfd5\">Codex Security TypeScript SDK</a> also lets you build scanning, progress reporting, cost controls, and cancellation into your own tools. The package is public, but running scans still requires Codex Security access. Some full-repository scans also require Trusted Access for Cyber.</p> <blockquote> <p>You can now use it to scan repositories, track findings across runs, verify fixes, and add security checks to CI/CD.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2082263717916586117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-07-29)</p> <h3 id=\"organize-sessions-and-extend-codex-cli-01460\">Organize sessions and extend Codex CLI 0.146.0</h3> <p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.146.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex CLI 0.146.0 (online)</a> lets you name a new chat with <code>/new release prep</code> or <code>/clear bug bash</code>, pin important threads, and switch between side conversations without closing them. It also adds temporary conversation forks, standalone web search for compatible custom model providers, executor-provided skills, and support for Agent Plugins manifests, workspace plugin publishing, and other plugin marketplaces.</p> <p>For custom clients, the <a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">app server</a> can filter pinned threads, create in-memory forks, inspect installed connector state, and read connector metadata. Experimental WebSocket support also connects app-server to remote Code Mode hosts. Review the <a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1?anchor=connect-the-cli-terminal-ui\">app-server security requirements (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> before exposing a remote connection. The release also improves proxy support, MCP reconnection, terminal responsiveness, and Windows sandbox reliability.</p> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-56-sol-for-hosted-codex-work\">Use GPT-5.6 Sol for hosted Codex work</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=recommended-models\">GPT-5.6 Sol</a> now powers Codex cloud code review and quality assurance for eligible customers. Sol is the flagship GPT-5.6 model for complex coding, research, computer use, and security work. Codex cloud selects its model automatically; Terra and Luna remain available on supported local and web surfaces.</p> <h3 id=\"prepare-for-the-gpt-54-model-retirement\">Prepare for the GPT-5.4 model retirement</h3> <p>On August 31, GPT-5.4 and GPT-5.4 mini will retire from Codex for users signed in with ChatGPT. Replace <code>gpt-5.4</code> with <code>gpt-5.6-terra</code> and <code>gpt-5.4-mini</code> with <code>gpt-5.6-luna</code> in workspace defaults, saved model settings, managed configurations, custom agents, and scheduled tasks.</p> <p>The OpenAI API and Codex sessions authenticated with an API key are not affected. Review the <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=deprecated-codex-models\">deprecated Codex models</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-7d04f9ab1f4a3eeb\">workspace model availability</a> before the cutoff.</p> <h2 id=\"july-2024-2026\">July 20–24, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"talk-through-work-with-chatgpt-voice\">Talk through work with ChatGPT Voice</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT Voice</a>, powered by GPT-Live, lets you talk through work and coordinate tasks in Chat, Work, and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app. Start a new chat or task in voice mode, then ask ChatGPT to start, check, or steer work in other threads.</p> <p>On macOS, say, “Take a look at this” to share an <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">appshot</a> of your frontmost window when <strong>Screen context</strong> is on.</p> <p>Voice is available with Plus, Pro, Business, Edu, and Enterprise plans in the desktop app and through <a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=set-up-mobile-access\">Remote on iOS</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E0ZMOschrTU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Building with ChatGPT Voice (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"work-across-multiple-folders-in-one-local-project\">Work across multiple folders in one local project</h3> <p>Local projects in the ChatGPT desktop app can now include multiple related folders. Choose a primary folder for new chats, Git operations, and automatic discovery of <code>AGENTS.md</code>, skills, and <code>config.toml</code>. Secondary folders remain available for file search, reading, and editing.</p> <p>Open <strong>Edit project</strong> to <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=use-local-projects-for-folders-and-codebases\">add folders and choose the primary folder</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-23-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the July 23 release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Local projects can now include related code, docs, and reference files from multiple folders.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2080390328880951299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-07-23)</p> <h2 id=\"july-1317-2026\">July 13–17, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"keep-work-conversations-and-projects-together-on-desktop\">Keep Work conversations and Projects together on desktop</h3> <p>The ChatGPT desktop app now keeps Chat and Work conversations together in the ChatGPT view. Cloud Work conversations sync across web, mobile, and desktop; local Work conversations stay on your computer. ChatGPT Projects are available in the desktop app. Codex keeps its dedicated view and separate history for developer workflows.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f?anchor=compare-chatgpt-work-and-codex-on-desktop\">Compare ChatGPT Work and Codex on desktop</a> to choose the view that fits your task.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Open the Launch project, review its files and recent conversations, and continue the launch plan from the latest Work conversation.\n</code></pre> <h3 id=\"control-parallel-codex-work-with-codex-micro\">Control parallel Codex work with Codex Micro</h3> <p>On July 15, OpenAI and Work Louder launched <a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205\">Codex Micro</a>, a limited-run physical control surface for Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app. Its Agent Keys show the status of up to six chats and switch between them. Customizable Command Keys, an analog stick, and a dial can trigger common actions or skills, start push-to-talk, and adjust reasoning effort without leaving the keyboard.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m8uUUUsMD3Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing the Codex Micro (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-56-through-amazon-bedrock\">Use GPT-5.6 through Amazon Bedrock</h3> <p>GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna reached general availability through Amazon Bedrock. Local ChatGPT Work and Codex surfaces can use the built-in <a href=\"#/article/a-fc9fbba758a53038\"><code>amazon-bedrock</code> provider</a> with a Bedrock API key or the AWS SDK credential chain. This includes Work and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app, Codex CLI, the IDE extension, and the Codex SDK.</p> <h3 id=\"inspect-codex-task-visualizations-on-ios\">Inspect Codex task visualizations on iOS</h3> <p>ChatGPT for iOS 1.2026.188 added inline visualizations to Codex tasks and improved creating and managing tasks from conversations, including reliable links to newly created tasks. Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-07-13-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">July 13 iOS release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"july-610-2026\">July 6–10, 2026</h2> <p><a id=\"take-on-ambitious-work-with-chatgpt-work\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"take-on-ambitious-work-in-chatgpt\">Take on ambitious work in ChatGPT</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c7688c996bc9669\">ChatGPT Work</a> in ChatGPT can gather context from your files and <a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">plugins</a>, take action across workflows, and create reviewable documents, presentations, spreadsheets, Sites, and other finished work. Powered by <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">GPT-5.6</a>, it can break a goal into steps and work for hours while you follow its progress, answer questions, change direction, and approve important actions.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a> can keep that work moving when you're away by running once, on a schedule, when an event occurs, or while monitoring for changes.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a launch brief from the attached research and campaign template. Show me the plan and flag missing information before you build the final document, then adapt the approved brief into assets for three markets.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yRc5HcGJ-Cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Meet ChatGPT Work (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"choose-the-right-gpt-56-model\">Choose the right GPT-5.6 model</h3> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=recommended-models\">GPT-5.6 family</a> offers three recommended models across ChatGPT Work, the ChatGPT desktop app, Codex CLI, and the Codex IDE extension. Sol is the flagship for complex coding, computer use, research, and security work. Terra balances capability and cost for everyday work, while Luna is the fastest, lowest-cost option. The default <strong>Power</strong> setting uses Sol with medium reasoning.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MPGU2a67Ls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Meet GPT-5.6 (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"use-codex-in-the-chatgpt-desktop-app\">Use Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app</h3> <p>On July 9, the Codex app merged into the <a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT desktop app</a> for macOS and Windows. Codex keeps its dedicated coding experience alongside ChatGPT's Chat and Work. The Codex experience includes inline editing in diffs, pull request review in the side panel, faster <a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a> powered by GPT-5.6, and multi-repository projects.</p> <p>Existing Codex app users can update as usual. You can make Codex the default view, use the Codex logo as the app icon, and access desktop Codex projects from the ChatGPT mobile app. The updated desktop app is available globally on every ChatGPT plan, including Free.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ga792ftrBu4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Codex for Engineering teams (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"june-1519-2026\">June 15–19, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"turn-demonstrated-workflows-into-reusable-skills\">Turn demonstrated workflows into reusable skills</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-2c6e218368c091d9\">Record &amp; Replay</a> lets you show ChatGPT or Codex a workflow on macOS and turn the demonstration into a reusable skill. Use it for repetitive tasks that are easier to show than describe, then refine the generated skill and replay it with new inputs. Initial availability excludes the EEA, the United Kingdom, and Switzerland, and requires Computer Use.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZK3JhU73W18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Record &amp; Replay in Codex (online)</a></p> <p><a id=\"continue-a-task-on-another-host\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"continue-a-chat-on-another-host\">Continue a chat on another host</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=hand-off-a-chat-between-hosts\">Chat handoff</a> moves a chat and its Git state between your local computer and a connected remote host. Codex can create or reuse a worktree on the destination, transfer the chat, and continue from the matching project.</p> <p>The same desktop release adds bulk actions to scheduled run history, so you can mark every run as read or archive eligible runs together.</p> <h3 id=\"browse-and-review-workspaces-from-ios\">Browse and review workspaces from iOS</h3> <p>In the ChatGPT mobile app, <strong>Remote</strong> added a workspace file browser, a directory picker for new chats, expand-and-collapse controls for diffs, and per-chat or cross-chat MCP approval choices on iOS.</p> <p>Computer Use, the Chrome extension, Memories, and Chronicle also began rolling out to the EEA, the United Kingdom, and Switzerland. Memories remain off by default in those regions, and Chronicle is an opt-in research preview for ChatGPT Pro subscribers on macOS.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-15-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 15 iOS</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-16-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 16 availability</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-18-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 18 app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <h2 id=\"june-812-2026\">June 8–12, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"debug-web-apps-with-browser-developer-mode\">Debug web apps with Browser Developer mode</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-developer-mode\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Developer mode (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> gives Codex controlled access to Chrome DevTools Protocol capabilities in Chrome and the built-in browser. Codex can inspect network traffic, console output, runtime errors, and page state while it profiles or debugs your app. Under <strong>Developer mode</strong> in <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Browser</strong>, turn on <strong>Enable full CDP access</strong>. Codex asks for explicit approval before it uses that access on a website.</p> <p>Browser use is also up to twice as fast because CDP and DOM snapshot optimizations reduce browser round trips.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex Browser settings with Developer mode enabled</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Browser to reproduce the slow checkout. Inspect the network timing and console errors, fix the cause, and verify the result.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhgYFRZLyKI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Debug web apps with browser use in Codex (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"bring-your-setup-to-codex\">Bring your setup to Codex</h3> <p>New migration flows can import supported setup from other coding agents during onboarding. The Codex app also added <code>/init</code> for creating project instructions, plus improved plugin management, browser diagnostics, and completed-chat summaries.</p> <p><a id=\"set-up-codex-tasks-from-ios\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"set-up-codex-chats-from-ios\">Set up Codex chats from iOS</h3> <p>Remote on iOS can now choose a branch, create a worktree, run an environment setup script, manage goals, and add inline review comments.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-09-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 9 app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-09-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 9 iOS</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-06-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">June 11 app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <h2 id=\"june-15-2026\">June 1–5, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"build-and-deploy-websites-with-sites\">Build and deploy websites with Sites</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites</a> lets ChatGPT create, save, deploy, and inspect websites, dashboards, internal tools, web apps, and games hosted by OpenAI. Sites has a dedicated entry point in ChatGPT on the web and desktop, where you can return to projects and manage hosted environment values and secrets without assembling a separate deployment stack.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Build a responsive launch dashboard from this project with Sites. Validate it at mobile and desktop sizes, then save a version for review. Do not deploy it until I approve the saved version.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VRvC5smyzso\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing Sites in Codex (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"use-codex-with-amazon-bedrock\">Use Codex with Amazon Bedrock</h3> <p>You can <a href=\"#/article/a-fc9fbba758a53038\">use Codex with Amazon Bedrock</a> for local workflows with AWS-managed authentication, account controls, and billing. Remote on iOS also added an optional in-app lock, follow-up behavior settings, line wrapping for diffs, and SSH connections to Windows machines. The desktop app added terminal placement controls and activity insights in the profile view.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=month-2026-06\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read all June 2026 release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>OpenAI models and Codex, now in your AWS workflows.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2061564710173224985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-06-01)</p> <h2 id=\"may-2529-2026\">May 25–29, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"use-windows-apps-and-control-codex-remotely\">Use Windows apps and control Codex remotely</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c?anchor=windows-foreground-use\">Computer use</a> added support for seeing, clicking, and typing in Windows desktop apps. Install the Computer Use plugin before starting. On Windows, Codex uses the active desktop and takes over the foreground while the task runs. Remote connections also support Windows. In the ChatGPT mobile app, open <strong>Remote</strong> to start work on a Windows device, or use a Mac running the ChatGPT desktop app and check progress from elsewhere.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Computer to open the Windows app, reproduce the export failure, save a diagnostic file, and summarize the exact steps that trigger the problem.\n</code></pre> <p>Remote on iOS also added Spotlight and Shortcuts entry points, archived-chat browsing, <code>/side</code>, and options to save or copy rendered images. The desktop app added chat coordination for local projects and worktrees, content and branch-name search for past chats, and consistent visual identifiers for background subagents.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-25-mobile\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">May 25 iOS</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-28-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">May 29 app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MPIAB-8VmCo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Windows Computer Use and mobile access for Codex (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"may-1822-2026\">May 18–22, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"give-codex-context-from-any-mac-app-with-appshots\">Give Codex context from any Mac app with Appshots</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a> send the frontmost app window to Codex with a screenshot and available text when you press both Command keys. Codex gets working context from design tools, dashboards, documents, and other apps without requiring you to copy, paste, or describe what's on screen.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use this appshot as the visual reference. Match the selected screen in the app, then open a preview and compare spacing, typography, and color.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QKYbGCvNpFo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing Appshots in Codex (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"follow-long-running-goals\">Follow long-running goals</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">Goal mode</a> left experimental status and is available in the Codex app, IDE extension, and CLI for objectives that can take hours or days. <a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c?anchor=locked-use\">Locked use</a> lets Codex continue approved computer-use work after a Mac locks, including through <strong>Remote</strong> in the ChatGPT mobile app. ChatGPT Business workspaces can also <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/plugins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">share reusable plugin bundles with workspace members</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-21\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the May 21 launch notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rgh0hMYPcd0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Run long tasks in Codex using goals (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"may-1115-2026\">May 11–15, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"continue-desktop-work-from-mobile\">Continue desktop work from mobile</h3> <p>In the ChatGPT mobile app, <strong>Remote</strong> connects to a Mac running the ChatGPT desktop app. Because work runs on the connected host, your projects, files, credentials, plugins, skills, and configuration remain available when you continue from your phone. See <a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">Remote connections</a> to set up a host and pick up work from another device.</p> <blockquote> <p>Now in preview: Codex in the ChatGPT mobile app.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2055016850849993072\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-05-14)</p> <h3 id=\"automate-trusted-workflows\">Automate trusted workflows</h3> <p>Hooks reached general availability for running custom commands at key points in the agent lifecycle. ChatGPT Enterprise admins can also enable <a href=\"#/article/a-f5bc151215cdfb88\">Codex access tokens</a> for trusted scripts, schedulers, and private CI runners. Enterprise guidance expanded to cover managed setup and controls for Codex.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-13-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the May 14 launch notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Codex is getting easier to automate and customize around your code.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2055032115964870838\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-05-14)</p> <h2 id=\"may-48-2026\">May 4–8, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"work-across-browser-tabs-with-the-chrome-extension\">Work across browser tabs with the Chrome extension</h3> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Chrome extension</a> can work in parallel across tabs in the background without taking over your browser. You control which websites Codex can use, making it practical to combine research, data entry, and verification across web apps in one task.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare the open product pages, collect the plan limits in a table, cite each source tab, and flag any differences that need a manual check.\n</code></pre> <p>The Codex app also added dictation cleanup and a custom dictionary for names, file paths, and code symbols. ChatGPT Enterprise workspace owners can allow members to create <a href=\"#/article/a-f5bc151215cdfb88\">Codex access tokens</a> for trusted, non-interactive local workflows.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-05-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">May 5 app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-05\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">May 5 access-token</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-05-07\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex for Chrome</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> launch notes.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6Mxcv1pyBU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Codex can now use Chrome directly on macOS and Windows (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"april-2024-2026\">April 20–24, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"use-gpt-55-for-complex-work\">Use GPT-5.5 for complex work</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">GPT-5.5</a> arrived in Codex as the recommended model for most tasks, with strengths across implementation, debugging, testing, computer use, research, and finished knowledge-work outputs.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blGtYq9mL18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing GPT-5.5 (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"let-codex-operate-the-browser-and-review-approvals\">Let Codex operate the browser and review approvals</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-computer-use-in-the-browser\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Computer Use in the built-in browser (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> lets Codex click through local development servers and file-backed pages to reproduce issues and verify fixes. Eligible approval requests can also go through <a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">automatic approval review</a>, which shows the review status and risk before the action runs.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @Browser to open the local app, reproduce the checkout failure, fix it, and verify the flow end to end.\n</code></pre> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-23\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the April 23 launch notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>With GPT-5.5, Codex now gets more of the job done across the browser, files, docs, and your computer.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2047381283358355706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-04-23)</p> <h2 id=\"april-1317-2026\">April 13–17, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"preview-and-operate-work-in-one-place\">Preview and operate work in one place</h3> <p>The <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">built-in browser</a> added live previews and page comments, while <a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a> let Codex see and operate macOS apps. Together, they made visual implementation and end-to-end verification part of the same task as the code change.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT desktop app with a local web page open in the built-in browser</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lm7-yFZ5fZQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Codex for (almost) everything (online)</a></p> <p><a id=\"start-with-a-task-and-keep-it-moving\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"start-with-a-chat-and-keep-it-moving\">Start with a chat and keep it moving</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76?anchor=start-without-a-project\">Standalone chats</a> made it possible to begin without choosing a project folder. The same release added <a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?anchor=schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\">scheduled tasks inside a chat</a>, pull-request context, richer file previews, and <a href=\"#/article/a-7ea5a1f5cc6a25bc\">Memories</a> for work that spans chats.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-16-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Read the April 16 Codex app release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Automations can now run in the same thread, so Codex can pick up where it left off</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2044828148890812538\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAI on X (online)</a> (2026-04-16)</p> <h2 id=\"april-610-2026\">April 6–10, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"review-and-ship-pull-requests-in-the-app\">Review and ship pull requests in the app</h3> <p>The review experience added collapsible inline comments, inline and detached review modes, and clearer Git and source context. Pull-request activity, comments, and push choices then moved into the app alongside workspace file tabs, so you could inspect a change and respond without switching tools.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-09-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">April 9</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-04-10-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">April 10</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> Codex app release notes, or learn how to <a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">review changes in the app</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"march-2327-2026\">March 23–27, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"package-workflows-as-plugins\">Package workflows as plugins</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a> launched as installable bundles of skills, connectors, and MCP servers. They made complete workflows easier to discover, install, and share, while redesigned plugin and skill pages made their contents and status clearer. Search for past chats also arrived that week.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-24-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">task search</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-25\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">plugins launch</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-25-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <blockquote> <p>Plugins in Codex? We got you.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2037604273434018259\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-03-27)</p> <h2 id=\"march-1620-2026\">March 16–20, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"branch-earlier-and-choose-tools-from-the-composer\">Branch earlier and choose tools from the composer</h3> <p>You could fork a chat from an earlier message, making it easier to try a new approach without losing the original path. Model and reasoning commands became available while drafting, enabled skills appeared in the <code>@</code> menu, and GPT-5.4 mini added a faster option for lighter tasks and subagents.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-17\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">GPT-5.4 mini</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-18-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">chat control</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-19-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">skill menu</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <blockquote> <p>GPT-5.4 mini is more than 2x faster than GPT-5 mini. Optimized for coding, computer use, multimodal understanding, and subagents.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2033953815834333608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-03-17)</p> <h2 id=\"march-913-2026\">March 9–13, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"schedule-work-with-the-right-environment\">Schedule work with the right environment</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a> could run locally or in a worktree with an explicit model and reasoning level. Reusable templates made common tasks faster to configure, and custom themes made the workspace easier to personalize.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Scheduled task settings in the ChatGPT desktop app</p> <p>Automations are now GA.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2032222711032971548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-03-12)</p> <h3 id=\"let-codex-inspect-terminal-output\">Let Codex inspect terminal output</h3> <p>Codex also learned to read the <a href=\"#/article/a-3903992afce071c2?anchor=run-and-validate-your-project\">integrated terminal</a> for the current chat. It could inspect a running development server or build output directly instead of asking you to paste it.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every weekday, inspect changes from the last 24 hours, find one likely regression, fix it in a worktree, run the smallest relevant tests, and report the evidence.\n</code></pre> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-11-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">March 11</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-12-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">March 12</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> Codex app release notes.</p> <h2 id=\"march-26-2026\">March 2–6, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"run-codex-natively-on-windows\">Run Codex natively on Windows</h3> <p>The Codex app launched on <a href=\"#/article/a-ce14d03dc374424b\">Windows</a> with native PowerShell and sandbox support, plus worktrees, scheduled tasks, and skills. WSL remained available for developers who preferred a Linux environment.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex app running natively on Windows</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hNcRChDrNk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: The Codex app is now on Windows (online)</a></p> <p><a id=\"move-tasks-between-local-and-worktree\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"move-chats-between-local-and-worktree\">Move chats between Local and Worktree</h3> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306?anchor=working-between-local-and-worktree\">Local and Worktree handoff</a> made it possible to move an active chat while preserving its context. GPT-5.4 also arrived in Codex that week for coding, computer use, and longer-context workflows.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-04-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Windows launch</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-03-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">worktree handoff</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>, and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-03-05\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">GPT-5.4</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes.</p> <h2 id=\"february-913-2026\">February 9–13, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"iterate-in-real-time-and-branch-an-approach\">Iterate in real time and branch an approach</h3> <p>GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark entered research preview as a near-instant model for real-time coding iteration. The app also added chat forking and a floating, always-on-top chat window, so you could explore another approach or keep Codex beside an editor or browser.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-12\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Spark</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-12-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex app</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> release notes, or see the current <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">model guide</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Introducing GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark, our ultra-fast model purpose built for real-time coding.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2022009906329739681\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View @OpenAIDevs on X (online)</a> (2026-02-12)</p> <h2 id=\"february-26-2026\">February 2–6, 2026</h2> <h3 id=\"the-codex-app-launches-on-macos\">The Codex app launches on macOS</h3> <p>The Codex app launched as a desktop workspace for parallel project chats, built-in Git review, worktrees, skills, scheduled tasks, and voice dictation. Those capabilities now live in Codex in the <a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT desktop app</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: The original Codex app showing parallel project chats on macOS</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HFM3se4lNiw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch: Introducing the Codex app (online)</a></p> <h3 id=\"steer-active-work-and-add-files\">Steer active work and add files</h3> <p>Mid-turn steering made it possible to redirect Codex without stopping an active response, and file attachments expanded beyond images. These patterns became the foundation for <a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=steering-and-queuing\">steering and queuing</a> follow-ups with the context Codex needs.</p> <p>Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-02\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Codex app launch notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-02-05-app\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">February 5 app release notes</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p>"};
